\id JDG  
\h Thutan Vaihom Ho 
\toc1 Thutan Vaihom Ho 
\toc2 Thutan Vaihom Ho 
\toc3 Thutan Vaihom Ho 
\mt1 JUDGES  
\mt2 THUTAN VAIHOM HO  
\mt3 LEKHABU  
\is1 Judges lekhabu sung thu umdan  
\ip Thutan Vaihom Ho (Judges) thusim hi tulai vannoi mite nun le khan to jong vetkahna thei tampi aum in: tijat umtah kitha kimat, jonthanhoi chule khat le khat chungnun ding kichuna thudol aseijin ahi. Hitobang thusim ho hi sunggil lam’a dia kitil khouna phatah ahin, chujongleh hiche lekhabu hin kiloikhomna hoa kivaihomna akitup louteng, ipi sohji em, tijong aseijin ahi. Mihem ten, Pathen lam sanga kisih pum’a aka tengu leh, Pathen'in mihem te akhotona thudol jong aseiye. Hiche lekhabu hin Joshua thinung chule Leng ho phat masanga Israel te Canaan gam’a achen'u thudol jong aseijin ahi.  
\ip Judges lekhabu nasim’a kon'a hi, nangma mimal chung chang le thua nanun louna ho kikhol chilna nanei thei ding, chuteng lunghei le taona toh thoa Pathen toh na kiguijopna athahbeh a nasem phatthei ding ahi.  
\is1 Judges lekhabu jihpa chule ajih kum  
\ip Akhang-akhanga pat phat ahung chal dungjuijin Samuel themgao jih ahi akiti, hinlah koipen in ajih ham tihi kicheh tah in akisei poi. Chule Samuel toh kiloiho lah a khat penin anajih jong himai thei, ahilouleh Themgao ho lah a khatpen hidin ginchat ahi, akiti. Judges lekhabu hi 1000 BC vel’a kijih ahin, hiche lekhabua hin kum jathum le somnga sung thilsoh ho akijihlut in ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Judah leh Simeon in Gam Alah Lhon  
\p
\v 1 Joshua thinungin, Israel ten Pakai kom'a “Canaan mite sat dinga koi phung kon masa ding ham?” tin ana dongun ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Pakaijin “Judah kon masa ding ahi, ajeh chu hiche gam hi amaho khut a kana pehdohsa ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Hijeh chun Judah in asopipa Simeon kom'a chun, “Keima eikipe gamsunga Canaan mite toh kisat ding kahi, neihung kithopin chujou teng nangma naki pehna gam'a jong chun gal gasat khomna hite,” ati. Hiti chun Simeon’in Judah chu akithopin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Judah miten galmi ho chu aga nokhum’un ahileh Pakaijin Canaan mite le Periz mite chu gal ajosah in chule Bezek khopia chun galmi 10,000 athat un ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche Bezek mun'a chun Adoni-bezek lengpa chu akisatpi uvin gal chu anajou un chule Canaan mite leh Periz mite jong ajou uvin ahi.  
\v 6 Adoni-bezek ajamdoh in, ahinlah Israel ten ahin man un akhutpi leh akengpi ho chu atanboh peh un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Adoni-bezek in, “Keiman phat khat in leng somsagi ho chu akhutpiu leh akengpiu ho chu kana tanpeh in ka annehna dokhang noiya alhajah ho ana neuvin, keiman amaho kanabol bangin tun Pathen’in keima eilethuh tai,” ati. Ama chu Jerusalem'a ana puiyun hikom'a chun ana thitan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Judah ten Jerusalem ana sat un ana jou un agam'u ana lauvin amipi te ana that gam’un chule akhopiu chu meijin ana hallha tauvin ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche jou chun achesuh uvin Negev leh lhumlam thinglhang gama cheng Canaan mite akisatpi uvin ahi.  
\v 10 Hiche jou chun Judah ten Hebron’a cheng Canaan mite aga kisatpi uvin, (Hiche Hebron hi tumasanga chu Kiriath-arba ana kiti ahi) hichea chun, Shesai, Ahiman le Talmai galmi ho jong chu ana jouvun ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hichea kon chun amaho acheuvin Debir khopia chengho satdin akon tauve. Debir khopi jong hi masang chun amin Kiriath-sepher ana kitin ahi.  
\v 12 Caleb in koi hileh Kiriath-sepher gasat a ahin lajou pen-pen chu kachanu Acsah hi aji dinga kapeh ding ahi, ati.  
\v 13 Caleb naopa Kenaz chapa Othniel’in aga jouvin, hijeh chun Acsah chu Othniel’in akichenpi tai.   
\p
\v 14 Acsah in Othniel akichenpi jou chun, Othniel chun Acsah pa kom'a loumun khat thum dingin Acsah chun atil’in ahi. Hiti chun Acsah chu sangan chunga konna akum lhan, chuin Caleb’in “Ipi hitam?” tin ana dongin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Amanun jong “Thil khat neipeh ben kati ahi, nangin Negev gam chu neipeh ahitah leh twinah phung khat toh neipeh than,” ati. Hichun Caleb in twinah achungnung leh anoinung jong apehben ahi.   
\s1 Judah leh Benjamin phung mite galjona  
\p
\v 16 Judah phung miten lusulei khopi tia kihe Jericho khopi chu adalhah phat un, Mose nupa-pa chilhah Ken mite chun Judah gamthip gama chun akilhonpi kit tauvin ahi. Hiti chun amaho chutoh Negev gamsunga Arad khopi kom'a chun agamsung mipi ho chutoh agacheng khom tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche jou chun Judah chu Simeon toh apangkhom lhon'in Zephath a cheng Canaan mite chu agasat lhon'in, hiche khopi chu aga sumanghel lhon tan ahi. Hijeh chun hiche khopi chu Hormah ana sah un ahi.  
\v 18 Hiche ban ajong chun Judah in Gaza, Ashkelon chule Ekron khopi ho leh avel'a gamho chutoh alah tha tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Pakai chun, Judah mite chu ana umpin hiti chun ama hon thinglhang gam pumpi chu ana lokhum tauvin, ahivangin ama hon sakol thih kangtalai mangchaa phaicham a cheng ho chu ana deldoh jou pouvin ahi.  
\v 20 Mose’n ana thutep peh bangin Caleb chu Hebron ana peuvin ahi. Hiti chun Caleb in hiche mun'a cheng Anak chate chilhah thum ho chu ana nodoh in ahi. \x + \xo 1:20 \xt Joshua 15:13,14\x*   
\p
\v 21 Ahinlah Benjamin chaten vang Jerusalem’a chengho Jebus mite chu ana nodoh jou pouvin, hijeh chun tuni geiyin Jerusalem khopia Jebus mite hi Benjamin mite toh achengkhom un ahi. \x + \xo 1:21 \xt Joshua 15:63; 2 Samuel 5:6; 1 Thusimbu 11:4\x*   
\p
\v 22 Joseph chilhah ten Bethel khopi anasat un Pakaijin ana umpi uvin ahi.  
\v 23 Ama hon khopi velhi dingin mi ana sol'un (Tumasanga chu Luz ana kiti ahi).  
\v 24 Ama hon khopia konna hung potdoh mikhat chu ana kihoupi uvin, “Hiche khopi lutna ding lampi neihil'un, achutileh keihon khotona kamu sah diu nahi” atiuve.  
\v 25 Hiti chun aman alutna thei diu lampi chu ahil'in, amaho hiche lampi achun alut un hiche khopi sunga um jouse chu abon'in athat un, hiche mipa chule a insung mite sevang ahing hoijun ahi.  
\v 26 Khonungin hiche mipa chu Hit mite gama aga chenglut in, hichea chun khopi khat aphutdoh in, aman akhopi min chu Luz asah in tuni geijin hiche min chu apuden tan ahi.   
\s1 Israel phung dang hon adeldoh joulou miho  
\p
\v 27 Manasseh phungin Beth-shan, Taanach, Dor, Ibleam, Megiddo sunga cheng miho ahin, avel uva chengho ahiuvin anodoh jou pouvin ahi, ajeh chu hiche mun'a cheng Canaan mite chun hiche gamsunga chu chen den tei ding anatup u ahi. \x + \xo 1:27 \xt Joshua 17:11-13\x*  
\v 28 Israel te chu ahung hatdoh phat un, hiche Canaan mite chu sohna ana tohsah un, hinlah gamsunga kon chun adelmang jou pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Ephraim phung jong chun Gezer gamsunga cheng Canaan mite chu ana deldoh jou pouvin, hiti chun Canaan mite chu amaho lah a chun achengjom tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 1:29 \xt Joshua 16:10\x*   
\p
\v 30 Zebulun phung miten jong Kitron leh Nahalol gamsunga chengho ana nodoh jou pouvin, hiti chun Canaan mite chu alah uva chun achengden tauvin chule Canaan mite chu Zebulun ten sohna atohsah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Asher phung mite chun Acco, Sidon, Ahlab, Aczib, Helbah, Aphik chule Rehob gamsunga chengho anodoh jou pouvin ahi.  
\v 32 Ahin Asher phung mite chun hiche gamsunga ana chengte Canaan mite chu anodoh joulou jeh uvin, alah uvah chun aga chenlut tho tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Hitobang ma chun Naphtali phung chun Beth-shemesh leh Beth-anath gamsunga chengho ana nodoh jou pouvin ahi. Hiti chun Canaan mite lah a chun ana chenlut tho uvin ahi. Ahivangin, Beth-shemesh leh Beth–anath mipite chu Naphtali mipite sohna ana tohsah un ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Dan phung mite chu Amor miten thinglhang gama ale nolut kit un chule amaho chu phaicham ah ahung kumsuh tapouvin ahi.  
\v 35 Amor mite chu Heres, Aijalon le Shaalbim Mol lama chun chen den ding atup un ahi. Hinlah Joseph insung chu ahung hatdoh phat un Amor mite chu sohna atohsah tauvin ahi.  
\v 36 Amor mite gamgi chu Akrabbim a kon'in Sela ajonin hichea kon chun chunglang ajon toupeh in ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 Bokim mun'a Pakai vantil ahung  
\p
\v 1 Pakai vantil chu Gilgal'a kon'in ahung kaltouvin Bokim'a Israel te henga hitin ahung seiyin, “Keiman nangho hi Egypt gama konna kahin puidoh uva, napu napa teu peh dia kana kihahselna gam chu kahin lhut nahi tauve, chule Keiman kaseijin ‘Itih chan hijongleh kaki tepna chu kasuh keh louhel ding ahi,” tin kana seiye.  
\v 2 Hiche gamsunga nachen lut tengu leh, hiche gama cheng hotoh khun kitepna nasem thei louhel diu, amavang amaicham semna munhou na suhmang peh joh diu ahi. Chule nang hon kathupeh nanit pouvin na ngai pouve. Ipi dinga hitia hi um’ah nahiuvem? \x + \xo 2:2 \xt Potdohbu 34:12,13; Danbu Ni Na 7:2-5\x*  
\v 3 Hijeh chun keiman na gamsung uva chengho ka deldoh pehlou diu, amaho hi nangho dinga nasuboi jing uva pang diu, chule a pathen hou hi nangho dinga lhepna a pang jing diu ahi.”   
\p
\v 4 Pakai vantil chun Israel te kom'a athusei chu achai phat in mipi chu akapjah jengun ahi.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun hiche mun chu amin Bokim asah un (Hichu kana) tina ahi. Hichea chun ama hon Pakaiya kilhaina ana sem’un ahi.   
\s1 Joshua hinkho bei  
\p
\v 6 Joshua’n amaho chu alhahdoh phat in, ama-ama phungho cheh in agoulo mun agamsung cheh toupha dingin ache tauvin ahi.  
\v 7 Chule Israel mipi aboncha uvin Joshua hinlai sungse leh Joshua sanga hingsotjo gollui upaho Pakai thilbol loupi tah-tah ho anabol, amittah a ana muho hinlai sungse chun Israel ten Pakai kin chu anabol'un ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Pakai lhacha Nun chapa Joshua chu kum jakhat le som alhin'in ana thitan ahi.  
\v 9 Ama hon Gaash Mol sahlang Ephraim thinglhang gam, ama ana kipehna Timnath-serah gama chun anavui tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 2:9 \xt Joshua 19:49,50\x*   
\s1 Israel te Pakai thua nunglou  
\p
\v 10 Joshua khanga miho athisoh hel phat un, Israel khangthah ahung kisepdoh ho chun Pathen’in Israel te dinga thil thupi tah-tah ana boldoh peh ho leh, Ama jeng jong hepha le gelpha aum tapouve.   
\p
\v 11 Hiche phat hin Israel ten Pakai mitmun thil phalou tah-tah ana boldoh tauvin, chule Baal doi limsemthu ho chu ana hou tauve.  
\v 12 Egypt gama konna ahin puidoh uva apu apateu Pakai, Pathen chu ana nungsun tauvin, ama hon pathen dang ho nung ana juiyun avel uva cheng mite pathen ho chu ana houjo tauvin ahi. Hichun Pakai ana lunghan sah lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 13 Ama hon Pakai chu ana nungsun uva Baal leh Ashtoreth semthu pathen ho joh ana hou tauvin ahi.  
\v 14 Hiche hin Pakai chu Israel chunga nasatah in ana lunghan sah tan, hijeh chun Pakaijin amaho chu michom gamte khut ah apedoh tan Israel te chu ana chom tauve; chule Pakaijin amaho chu akimvel uva cheng agalmi hou khut ah ana pedoh tauvin, hijeh chun Israel te chun agal miteu ana tingjou tapouvin ahi.  
\v 15 Israel ten amaho kisatpi dinga akondoh chan’un Pakaijin amaho dounan gal asat jitan, Aman ana gihna bang chun gal alelsahji tauvin ahileh amaho chu ana lungkham lheh jengun ahi.   
\s1 Pakaijin amite ahuhdoh  
\p
\v 16 Chuin Pakaijin Israel te chu ahindel khum houva konna ahuhdoh ding'un thutan vaihom ho ana tundoh peh uvin ahi.  
\v 17 Ahivang'in Israel ten thutan vaihom ho thu ngai louvin pathen dang ho houna in numei kijoh ho bangin ana chon tauvin, Pakai thupeh dungjuiya ana chon apu apateu chonna lampia konna i-atileh ana kihei mangloichal jiuva ham?   
\p
\v 18 Pakaijin thutan vaihom ho Israel te chunga atundoh kom leh thutan vaihom ho chu ana mangchajin, amaho hinlai sung chun agalmi houva kon'in ana huhdoh jiuvin ahi. Ajeh chu Pakaijin a engbolna leh thohgimna thoh amipi te chu akhoto jin ahi.  
\v 19 Ahinlah thutan vaihom ho athi tengu leh, amipi te chu achonna u adihlou nau lampia akinungle kit jiuvin, ama hon pathen dang ana jui jiuvin, ajenle in ana pangun chujongleh ana hou jiuvin ahi. Hiti chun thil dihlou abol hou chu alouchal jeh un ana paidoh nomji pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hijeh chun Pakai chu Israel chung’ah nasatah in ana lunghang jin, Pakaijin hitin ana seiye, “Ajeh chu ka miten apu apateu toh kitepna kana sem chu asukeh un chule kathupeh jong nahsah louvin akoi tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Keiman, Joshua'n athi chan geija jousoh louva ana dalhah nam mite chu ka deldoh pehlou ding ahitai.  
\v 22 Israel te apu apa teuvin Pakai nung ana jui bang uva ajui uvam ajuilou uham ti, patepna keiman hiche hi kabol ahi.” ati.  
\v 23 Hiche jeh a chu Pakaijin hiche nam mite chu deldoh louva, Joshua chu abona ana josah lou ahi.   
\c 3  
\s1 Canaan a kidalha nam ho  
\p
\v 1 Hiche nam ho hi Canaan mite kisatna a ana pang khalou, Israel te patepna dinga Pakaijin gamsunga ana dalhah ho chu ahi.  
\v 2 Aman hiche hi galsatje hekhalou lai Israel khangthah ho galsatje akithem chuhna diuva abol ahi.  
\v 3 Hiche nam ho chu Philistine te (Phillistine vaipo nga ho noiya cheng ho chu ahiuve), Canaan mite jouse, Sidon mite chule Baal-hermon mol apat Lebo-hamath chan geiya kijam lhungpeh Lebanon mol chunga cheng Hiv mite ahiuve.  
\v 4 Pakaijin Mose mangchan apu apateu thupeh anapeh ho chu, Israel mite hin anit uham anitlou uham ti hetna dinga hiche mipite ho hi ana dalhah ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hiti chun Israel tehi Canaan mite, Hit mite, Amor mite, Periz mite, Hiv mite chuleh Jebus mite lah a cheng ahiuvin,  
\v 6 chuleh amaho toh akicheng touvin, Israel chapa ten amaho chanu te ho akichenpi uvin, chule Israel chanu te chu amaho chapa te toh kicheng dingin ana peuvin ahi. Hiti chun Israel ten amaho pathen ho chu ajenle tauve.   
\s1 Othniel thutan vaihom’a ahung pan  
\p
\v 7 Israel ten Pakai mitmun thilse jeng ana bol tauvin, ama hon a Pakai, a Pathen uchu asumil tauvin, chule ama hon Baal leh Asherah milim semthu ho chu jenle in ana pang tauvin ahi.  
\v 8 Hijeh chun Pakai chu Israel dounan alunghang lheh jeng tan, hijeh chun Aram-naharaim lengpa Cushan-rishathaim khut ah ana pedohtan, chuin Israel ten kumget sungin Cushan-rishathaim sohna ana tongun ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hinlah Israel mite chu Pakai kom'a panpi ngaichan ana kap tauvin ahileh, Pakaijin amaho huhdoh dingin mikhat ana tungdoh in, ama chu Caleb naopa Kenaz chapa Othniel ahi.  
\v 10 Pakai Lhagao chu achunga ahung chun hiti chun ama Israel te thutan vaihom’in ahung pangtan, chuin Othniel chu Aram lengpa Cushan-rishathaim chunga galbol din ahung kipan tan ahileh Pakaijin gal ana josah tan ahi.  
\v 11 Hijeh chun kum somli gamsunga chamna ana um in, chujouvin Kenaz chapa Othniel chu ana thitan ahi.   
\s1 Ehud thutan vaihom’a ahung pan  
\p
\v 12 Avelin Israel ten Pakai mitmun thilse jeng ana bolkit tauvin ahileh, hitobanga athilse bol jeh uhin Pakaijin Moab lengpa Eglon chu Israel te chungah ana vaihom sahtan ahi.  
\v 13 Eglon’in Ammon mite leh Amalek mite chu ana kiloikhompin, hiti chun ana kon'un Israel te chu anajou tauvin Lusu khopi tia kihe Jericho khopi chu ana toupha tauvin ahi.  
\v 14 Hiti chun Israel ten Moab lengpa Eglon noiya kum som le get sungin sohna ana tong’un ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Ahinlah Israel te chu panpi ngaichat nan Pakai kom'a ana kapjah jeng tauvin ahileh, Pakaijin amaho huhdoh dingin mikhat ahin tungdoh kit in, ama min chu Gera chapa Ehud ahi. Benjamin phunga konna khut-veicha pa chu anahi. Israel ten Moab lengpa Eglon kom'a kai apeh diu chu Ehud agathah sah un ahi.  
\v 16 Hiti chun Ehud in tongkhat a sao, alangtoa hem chemkhat ajetlam mal’ah ajeplut in pon akhu khum’in ahi.  
\v 17 Aman mithao tah Eglon kom'a chun kai peh ding sum chu ahin pon ahungin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Athilpeh chu apehchai phat in Ehud chu ache khompi cheng chutoh inlang che dingin ahung kipatdoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Hinlah Ehud chu Gilgal kom'a song milim kisem kom ahunglhun phat in ahung kileheijin, Eglon kom'a chun ahungin, “Keiman thuguh seiding khat kaneiye” ati.  
\p Hijeh chun lengpan ama lhachaho kom'a chun, “Thipbeh un” atin, amaho chu a indan sunga kon chun asoldoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Ehud chu a inchung dan a dap heova achangseh a tou Eglon kom'a chun achelut in Eglon kom'a chun, “Keiman Pathen a kon'in nang dinga thuthot khat kahinpoi ati.” Hitia chu Eglon lengpa chu atouna a konna adindoh chun,  
\v 21 Ehud in avei langin amal jetlam'a aje achem chu asatdoh in, lengpa oi achun aphut luttan ahi.  
\v 22 Chem chu alutthuh jeh in lengpa a-oi thao lah a chun achem kungjong chu alhum heltan ahi. Hijeh chun Ehud in chem chu anung loidoh tapon, chule amaha a kon chun lengpa eh jong ahungdoh leu tan ahi.  
\v 23 Hiche jou chun Ehud in hiche indan kot ho chu akam sohkeiyin kanglong aheh khum in, ehbuh langa achomlhan ajamdoh tai.   
\p
\v 24 Ehud achedoh jouphat chun lengpa lhacha ho chu ahung kinung leuvin ahileh, inchung dan kot jouse chu ana kikam sohkei chu agamu tauvin, ama hon insung dan a chu eh athah hi dingin agelun ahi.  
\v 25 Hijeh chun chomkhat set angah un, ahinlah phat sotthim tah anga vangun lengpa chu ahungdoh deh tapon, hichun atija uvin akot-heh chu agala tauvin ahileh, ama hon kot chu ahon phat un, apupau chu athisa lhonga kijam aga mudoh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Lhacha ho chu ageisangle kah uchun Ehud chu ajamdoh in song milim kisem lam chu ahopa in Seirah lam'ah ajamdoh tan ahi.  
\v 27 Ama Ephraim thinglhang gam alhun phat in Ehud chun gal konna ding sumkon amut tan, hichun Israel mi honkhat chu thinglhanga kon'in apuisuh in   
\p
\v 28 “Neijuiyun,” ati, “Ajeh chu nagal miho Moab mite chunga hi Pakaijin galjona napeh u ahitai,” ati. Hijeh chun ama hon ajuiyun, Moab a konna Jordan vadung galkaina palmun jouse chu atoupha uvin koimacha agal kaisah pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Sma hon Moab mite chu akisatpi uvin amaho lah a ahat pen ho leh galsat themcheh ho khatcha jong sohcha louhel in, mihem 10,000 athat un ahi.  
\v 30 Hiti chun Israel ten Moab te chu ana jouvun gamsunga chun kum somget jen chamna ana um'in ahi.   
\s1 Shamgar thutan vaihom’a ahung pan  
\p
\v 31 Ehud nungin Anath chapa Shamgar chun Israel te ana huhdoh in, aman bongchal khagu mangcha in khatvei chu Phillistine te mi 600 ana that in ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Deborah thutan vaihom’a ahung pan  
\p
\v 1 Ehud thi nungin, Israel ten Pakai mitmun thilse jeng abolkit tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Hijeh chun Pakaijin Canaan mi Hajor lengpa Jabin khut ah amaho chu apelut in, ama sepai lamkai chu Harosheth-haggoyim mi Sisera ahi.  
\v 3 Siserah in thih sakol kangtalai 900 aneijin, kum somni sungin Israel te ana sugenthei lheh jengin, hijeh chun Israel te Pakai kom'a panpi ngaiyin ana kap tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche phatlai sunga chu Lappidoth jinu Deborah hi themgao ahin chule Israel te chunga thu anatan a vai ana hom ahi.  
\v 5 Themgaonu chu Ephraim thinglhang gam Ramah le Bethel kikah a tumphung lim noiya ana touji ahin, hiche mun'a chun Israel te ana che jiuvin, amanun achungthu u ana tanpeh jiu ahi.  
\v 6 Nikhat Deborah chun, Naphtali gama Kedesh khopia cheng Abinoam chapa Barak aga kousah in, ama kom'a chun hitin ana seijin, “Hiche hi Israel Pathen'in na thupeh ahi, nangman Naphtali leh Zebulun phunga kon'in galsat mi 10,000 Tabor Mol chunga hin koukhom in.  
\v 7 Chutengleh keiman Jabin kiti lamkaipa le athih sakol kangtalai ho, chule agal mite chengse khu Kishon vadunga ka koudoh ding; chuteng amaho chunga galjona nangma kapeh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Barak in jong adonbut in “Nangman nei kilhonpi ding leh che nange,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Deborah in adonbut in, “Aphalheh jenge keiman kalhonpi ding nahi, ahinlah tuchung kalsonna a hi nangin minphatna namu louding ahi, ajeh chu Sisera chunga Pakaijin galjona eipeh diu hi numei khutna konna bou hi ding ahi”, ati. Hiti chun Deborah in Barak chu Kadesh geiyin ahin kilhon lutpi tai.  
\v 10 Kadesh a chun, Barak in Zebulun leh Naphtali phunga kon'in galsat mi sangsom akou khom in ama hon ahin juiyun, Deborah injong akilhonpin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hikom'a chun Mose nupapa Hobab chilhah holah a Ken mi Heber chun ama phung lah a kon'in apotdoh in, achombeh in Kedesh kom Zaanannim gangpi phung kom'a chun aponbuh ana songin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Sisera jah a chu Abinoam chapa Barak chu Tabor Mol chunga akaltoutai, tia aseiphat uvin,  
\v 13 aman thih sakol kangtalai 900 leh a sepai jouse akoudoh in Harosheth-haggoyim ana kon'in Kishon vadung geiya ahung tou un ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Deborah in Barak kom'a aseijin, “Kigosadem’in um'in tunia hi Pakaijin Sisera chunga galjona napeh ding ahi, ajeh chu Pakai hi na masanga akalsong tan ahi,” ati. Hiti chun Barak in galsat ding mi 10,000 chu alamkaijin Tabor Mol a kon chun akumsuh tauvin galmun chu ajonlut tauve.  
\v 15 Barak in ahin nokhum phat chun Pakaijin Sisera leh asakol kangtalai jouse leh agalsat ding jouse chu asuh nohphah pehtan, Sisera chu asakol kangtalai a kon'in akichomlhan akengin ajamdoh tan ahi.  
\v 16 Hichun Barak in sakol kangtalai ho leh agal miho chu Harosheth-haggoyim chan gei chun adellut in, Sisera galmi jouse chu athat gamsoh hel'in khatcha ahing hoi tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche kahlah chun Sisera chu Ken mi Heber jinu Jael ponbuh a ana jamlut in ahi, ajeh chu Heber insung mite leh Hazor lengpa Jabin chu jolle gol hina a ana kihou thei ahiuve.  
\v 18 Jael chu apotdoh in Sisera chu akimupin akom'a hitin ana seiye, “Kaponbuh sunga hunglut in, kapu kicha louhel'in hunglut in,” ati. Hiti chun aponbuh sunga ana lut in aman ponsil khat in ana khu khum’in ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Sisera in Jael henga chun, “Twi don ding themkhat neihin pen kadang achah behseh e,” ati. Hiti chun amanun savun peng sunga bongnoi themkhat chu anapen pon chu akhu khum kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Sisera’n amanu kom'a chun, “Ponbuh kot phung kom'a chun dingin lang koitobang hamkhat ahunga na insung’a mi khattou um am tia ahung holleh aumpoi tin,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Ahinlah Sisera chu athachol behseh jeh a a-imut mil hel phat chun Jael chun, thih hemkhat akhutna achoijin ama kom'a chun guhthim chan alut in hichun ponbuh thih hem chu angeichang a akhenlut in toltoh akhen mat jengin ahileh ama athitan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Barak chu Sisera hol'a ahung chun Jael chu apotdoh in akimupin hitin aseiye, “Hungin na mihol chu keiman na vetsah inge” ati. Hiti chun aman ponbuh sunga chun ajuilut in ahileh, Sisera chu achalpanga ponbuh thih kikhenlutna athisa a alup chu agamu in ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hiche nikho chun Canaan lengpa Jabin chu Pakaijin ajopeh tauve ti Israel ten amuchen tauvin ahi.  
\v 24 Hiche nikhoa pat chun Israel te chu Jabin lengpa dounan ahung hatdoh un ajonan asumang hel tauvin ahi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Deborah le Abinoam chapa Barak labol  
\p
\v 1 Hiche nichun Deborah leh Abinoam chapa Barak in hihe la hi asa lhon'e.   
\b  
\q1
\v 2 “Israel lamkai hon alamkaiyun  
\q2 chule mipin kipah tah in anung’u ajuiyun,  
\q1 Pakai chu thangvah in umhen!   
\b  
\q1
\v 3 “Leng te ho ngaitem un!  
\q2 Nangho vaihom mithupi ho phaten ngaitem uvin!  
\q1 Keiman Pakai thangvahna la kasah ding,  
\q2 Pakai Israel Pathen kom'a tumging tum pum’a  
\q1 keiman la kasah ding ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 4 “Pakai nangma Sier mun'a kon nahung kipatdoh a  
\q2 Edom phai nahin lonkhum chun,  
\q1 leiset pumpi akithing jengin,  
\q2 chule vanlai jol'a meilhang jeng jong gotwi juh in ahung julhai.   
\q1
\v 5 Pakai Sinai Mol chu nahung kilandoh phat in,  
\q2 mol ho chu Israel Pakai, Pathen masang'ah akithing jengin ahi. \x + \xo 5:5 \xt Potdohbu 19:18\x*   
\b  
\q1
\v 6 Anath chapa Shamgar nikholai  
\q2 chuleh Jael nikho laijin  
\q1 mipi ten lamlen jeng jong apelun,  
\q2 kholjin ho jengin jong lampel lang ajotji tauve.   
\q1
\v 7 Israel te minu banga Deborah ahung kipat tokah chun  
\q2 Israel thinglhang khoho a mihem themkhat bou ana kidalha tan ahi.   
\q1
\v 8 Israel ten pathen thah thahho ahin kilhen phat un  
\q2 khopi kelkot phungho a gal ahung pohjal jengin ahi.  
\q1 Ahinlah Israel galmi sang somli ho lah a chun  
\q2 tengcha le lum akimudoh pon ahi.   
\q1
\v 9 Kalungthim pumpi hi Israel gal lamkai galsat dinga  
\q2 hung kipedoh ho chung achengin ahi.  
\q1 Pakai chu thangvah in umhen!   
\b  
\q1
\v 10 “Nangho sangan hoitah tah chunga kampol pon  
\q2 hoitah tah toupha a lhaiho leh  
\q1 lamlen dunga vahle hon ngaito uvin!   
\q1
\v 11 Thinglhang’a la a sathem tahtah ho  
\q2 twi lonlhahna vadung panghoa akikhom’un  
\q1 Pakai chonphatna galjona loupitah tah asamphong uve.  
\q2 Hiche jou chun Pakai mipi te  
\q1 khopi kelkot phung lang jonin  
\q2 ahung konsuh tauve.   
\b  
\q1
\v 12 “Thouvin, Deborah, thouvin!  
\q2 Thouvin, thouvin la saovin!  
\q1 Thouvin, Barak!  
\q2 Abinoam chapa na gal-hing mat ho hinkaijin!   
\b  
\q1
\v 13 Tabor molla kon'in milen milal ho themcha bou ahung kijot suh ui.  
\q2 Pakai mipi chu gal-hattah ho nokhum dingin ahung kijot suh un ahi.   
\q1
\v 14 Amalek mitea konna kilahpeh  
\q2 Ephraim'a kon'in ahungsuh un  
\q1 Benjamin, nangma le na sepai te nahin jui uve.  
\q2 Makir a kon'a gallamkai ho ahungsuh uvin  
\q1 Zebullun na kon'in gal lamkaiho manchah choiho ahungun ahi.   
\q1
\v 15 Issachar a leng chapa te chu Deborah leh Barak lam’ah apangun ahi.  
\q2 Ama hon Barak ahinjui un phaicham langa ahung lhailut un ahi.  
\q2 Ahinla Reuben phung sung’a vang lungkhat ahithei pouve.   
\q1
\v 16 Ibol'a nangho kelngoi hon ho lah a nomsatah a na touthim uva  
\q2 kelngoi chingho saisip sap chu namoh ngai-gai uham?  
\q1 Ahinla Reuben phung sunga vang  
\q2 kilungkhatna anei thei pouve.   
\q1
\v 17 Gilead vang Jordan solam'a aumden tan  
\q2 chule Dan chu ipi dinga inmun'a um nalai ham?  
\q1 Asher vang twikhanglen panga kongkai munna  
\q2 achengden tan ahi.   
\q1
\v 18 Ahinlah Zebulun vang Naphtali te ho bol bangin  
\q2 gal kisat khoh laitah a chun ahinkhou phal ngam’in pan alauvin ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 19 Canaan lengte ahungun Megiddo twinah phung kom'a chun  
\q2 Taanach munnah gal asatnin imacha alemlo pon ahi.   
\q1
\v 20 Chunga ahsi ten van'a kon'in gal asatnin,  
\q2 ahsi ten akikhai khum nauva kon'in Sisera dounan gal ahin sat un ahi.   
\q1
\v 21 Kishon vadungin alhohmang gam tauve.  
\q2 Kishon kiti gollui laija twi hattah chutoh  
\q1 kalhagao hangsan tah in kijot khom lhon tan.   
\q1
\v 22 Hiche jou chun sakol kengin leiset achon in,  
\q2 Sisera sakol thupitah chu akinunkho jing jengin ahi.   
\q1
\v 23 ‘Meroz mite chu sapsetna changhen,’ tin Pakai Vantil ten aseije  
\q2 nasatah in sapsetna changuhen tin asam’un ahi,  
\q1 ajeh chu amaho galsat hattah hotoh kisatto dingin  
\q2 Pakai langa pang dinga ahung pouvin ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 24 Numei lah a phatthei chang chungnung Ken mi Heber jinu Jael ahi.  
\q2 Amanu hi numei ponbuh sung’a chengho jouse lah a nunnompen hen.   
\q1
\v 25 Sisera in twi anathum’in ahileh  
\q2 aman bongnoi ana donsah e.  
\q1 Mithupi tahho peh dinga kilom khon achun,  
\q2 bongnoi ha tuitah achoipeh e.   
\q1
\v 26 Hiche jou chun akhut veilam'a ponbuh thih hemkhat achoijin  
\q2 chule akhut jet lam'a natohna sehcha chu achoijin  
\q1 hiche sehcha chun Sisera chu akhenin, aluchang akhenchip tai.  
\q2 Aman hakhetnin akhenin angeichang chu akhen lhumtai.   
\q1
\v 27 Ama alhulhop jengin,  
\q2 amanu kengphang kom'a chun akijam jeng'e.  
\q1 Chuleh alhuh lhopna achun athiden tai.   
\b  
\q1
\v 28 Bangkot a kon chun Sisera nu ahung khodah in,  
\q2 hiche bangkot a kon chun achapa hung kile ding chu galdot jing  
\q1 pumin hitin aseije, “I-atile tugeija sakol kangtalai chu hung kilelou?  
\q2 Itidan'a sakol kangtalai khogin tugeija kija louva ham?” ati.   
\b  
\q1
\v 29 “Numei ching theitah kilhamonna thucheng hin  
\q1 avel vellin hiche thucheng hin ama le ama akidonbut in ahi.   
\q1
\v 30 'Amaho hi athil chomdoh uchu kihom'u hinte,  
\q2 numei khat le ni pasal khat cheh changun te.  
\q1 Sisera dingin ponjem hoitah tah gong’un tin,  
\q2 chule ponjem hoitah a kikhong kei dingin jong hin gong’un te' ati.  
\q1 Akichomdoh ho lah a chu alangtoa ponjem hoitah tah a  
\q2 kikhong ho jong jao ding ahinai.   
\b  
\q1
\v 31 Pakai, nagal mite ho jouse Sisera te bangin thina toh cheh uhen!  
\q2 Amavang nangma ngailu jouse chu nisa bangin thanei tah in khangtou jing tauhen!”  
\b  
\q1 Hiti chun gamsunga kum 40 geijin chamna ana um'in ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Gideon Thutan Vaihom’a Ahung Pan  
\p
\v 1 Israel ten Pakai mitmun thilse jeng anabol tauvin ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin amaho chu kum sagi sungin Midian mite khut a ana pedoh kittan ahi.  
\v 2 Midian te chu akhoh behseh jengun ahileh Israel te chun amaho leh akihinso theina dingun molchung ho leh songko ho chuleh kulpi hoilai lai jah kiselna ding akisem'un ahi.  
\v 3 Israel ten chang le mim akitu teng’u le Midian mite le Amalek mite chuleh solam mite ahungun Israel te chu ahung delkhum jiuvin ahi.  
\v 4 Amaho chu agamsung a chun apansaden jiuvin, alousohga ho asuhsetpeh jiuvin, Gaza chan geijin Israel te gancha ho kelngoi ho le kelcha ho chuleh asangan hou achompeh jiuvin, aneh diu imacha ana khenpehji pouvin ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche galmi ho chu agancha houleh aponbuh utoh ahung kon jiuvin khaokho te jat aphauvin, asangongsao tamtah simsenlou ho chutoh ahung tollutji uvin ahi. Amaho chun agamsung chu abah gamhel tokah un aumden jiuvin ahi.  
\v 6 Hiti chun Israel te chu Midian te jeh in kel in aumji tauvin ahi; chuphat chun Israel te chu Pakai kom'ah panpi ngeh in ana kapjah jeng tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Midian ten asuh genthei jeh uva aka jah jeng phat un  
\v 8 Pakaijin Israel te kom'ah themgao khat anasol tan ahi. Aman hitin ana seije, “Hiche hi Pakai Israel te Pathen'in asei ahi, ‘Ken nangho Egypt a na sohchan nauva konna kahin puidoh u nahi tauve.  
\v 9 Egypt mite a kon leh nangho na sugenthei hou jousea kon'a kahin huhdoh u nahi tauve, Keiman nagal mite chu kadel mang peh un hiche gam hi nangho kapeh u nahi tauve.  
\v 10 Keima hi Pakai na Pathen'u kahi, tua nachon nauva agam mi Amor mite pathen ho hi nahou louhel diu ahi, kana tin ahi, ahinlah nang hon kasei na ngai pouvin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hiche jou chun Pakai vantil chu Ophrah kiti mun a thingphung lentah noiya chun ahung touvin ahi. Hiche Ophrah kiti hi Abiezer phungmi Joash kitipa a ahi. Joash chapa Gideon chun lengpi thei hehna sunga chu suhlou chang anavoh a Midian mite a konna achaang chu sel ana go in ahi.  
\v 12 Pakai Vantil chu ahung kilah in ajah a, “Mihat gal-hang nangma Pakaijin na umpi jinge,” ahintin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Gideon’in adonbut in “Hepu, Pakaijin eiumpi uva ahileh hitobang hahsatna hi kathoh diu ham? Kapu kapa teuvin, Pakaijin thil kidang ana tohdoh peh eina seipeh ho chu hoilang geiyah hitam? Pakaijin Egypt gam'a konna eina puidoh u hitalou ham? Ahin tunvang Pathen'in einuse tauvin chule Midian mite khut a eipehdoh u ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hiche jou chun Pakaijin amalam ahin ngan, “Na thahatna chu mangchan lang Midian te a kon'in Israel te chu gahuhdoh tan, hiche dinga chu keiman nang hi kasol nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Ahin, Gideon'in adonbutnin, “Pakai ken Israel chu iti kahuhdoh jou ding ham? Kaphung jong hi Manasseh phung lah a alhasam pen ahin chuleh keima tah jeng jong hi ka insung lah uva aneopen kahi bouve” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Pakaijin Gideon kom'a chun, “Keiman nanga kaumpi jing ding ahi. Chuleh nangman mikhat seh toh kisatto banga Midian te chu na suhmang sohhel ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Gibeon'in adonbut in, “Nangin nei kithopi mong ding ahileh Pakaijin kakom'a hin thu asei mong-mong'e ti kihet theina dingin melchihna khat neipen,” ati.  
\v 18 “Keima kahung kilekit a nakom'a maicham a toding kahin choi tokah in ana potdoh hihbeh in” ati. Hichun aman jong “Nahung kilekit kahsen hikom'a hin anaum jing nange,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Gideon gangtah in a inlang’a achen, kelcha dongkhat aga hon’in, changbong pocha khat alan, chol sollou changlhah themkhat aga kangin ahi. Hiche jou chun asahon chu pocha khat a ahin domin atwi jong belkhat ah ahin choijin thingphung len noija ana tou vantil kom'ah aga luipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Pathen vantil chun akom'ah, “Sa me kihon chuleh cholsolou changlhah chu songpi chunga chun koijin lang chuleh, satwi chu achungah sunglhan,” ati. Chuin Gideon chun akiseipeh bang chun abollin ahi.  
\v 21 Hiche jou chun Pakai Vantil'in akhutna achoi atenggol monghem achun kelchasa le changlhah chu agah tongkhan ahileh songpia kon chun mei ahung koudoh in ahin choiho jouse chu akavam tan ahi. Hiche jou chun Pakai vantil chu amang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Chutah chun Gideon'in jong Pakai vantil mong-mong ahinai ti ahechen tai, hiche jeh chun Gideon in hitin aseitai, “Pakai, keima amangthah kahitai, ajeh chu keiman Pakai vantil chu kimaiton kakimupin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Hichun Pakaijin adonbutnin, “Lungmong'in, Imacha tiponte, Kicha hih in. Nathi louding ahi,” ati.  
\v 24 Chuphat in, Gideon'in Pakai maicham khat asemin amin Yahweh-Shalom asah in ahi (Hichu Pakai hi chamna ahi tina ahi). Hiche maicham chu Abiezer phung mite gam Ophrah munnah tuni geijin aum jing nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hiche jan machun Pakaijin Gideon kom'ah hitin aseipeh tai, “Napa gancha lah a kon'in kum sagi lhingsa bongchal ani channa chu hinkaijin lang, napan ana tundoh Baal maicham chu volhu inlang chuleh akom'a kitung Asherah doikhom chu satlha jengin.  
\v 26 Chujou tengleh Pakai na Pathen maicham khat hiche thinglhang leh amuntheng’ah khun tungdoh inlang, songho chu phatah in goltoh inlang, Asherah doikhom nasat lhuh chu meitina’n mangin lang bongchal chu maicham chunga chun pumgo thilto in tohdoh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Hijeh chun Gideon'in alhachaho mi som akipuijin Pakaijin bollin ati bang- bang chun aboltan ahi. Ahinlah khopi miho leh apa insungmi adang ho akichat jeh in janin abollin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Ajing jingkah matah in khopi mite ho chu ahungtho phat un Baal doikhom maicham chu ana kivolhu tan chuleh akom'a kitung Asherah doikhom jong chu ana kisat lhutan ahi, ti amudoh tauvin ahi. Hiche ho khel chun maicham thah khat ana kitungdoh in hiche chunga chun bongchal pumgo thiltoa ana kitodoh jong chu amu uvin ahi.  
\v 29 Mipi ho chu khat le khat akihouvun “Koi bol ahidem”? atiuvin ahi. Hitia akihoutoh le uva ahin kholchil phat un Joash chapa Gideon ahi ti ahin hedoh tauve.   
\p
\v 30 Khopi mite ho chun Joash kom'ah “Nachapa chu hin puidoh in, Baal maicham asuhset jeh leh Asherah doikhom asat lhuh jeh a ama hi thi tei-tei ding ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 31 Ahinlah Joash chun ama hung nokhum mipi ho chu ale senjah jengin, “Ipi dinga nang hon Baal doi dinga naseipeh uva nahuh uham? Koi hileh ama huhna a thusei pen-pen chu jing le jingkah langa kithat ding ahi. Baal hi pathen dihtah mong ahileh ama chungthu aman kisei nante, chuleh ama maicham asuse pen-pen chu aman kisuhmang nah hih ding ham?” ati.  
\v 32 Hijeh chun hiche nia pat chun Gideon chu Jerub-baal asah tauve. Hichu “Baal chun amapa chunga aphu kilah hen,” tina ahi, ajeh chu aman Baal maicham ana vohchim ahi.   
\s1 Gideon In Melchihna Athum  
\p
\v 33 Hiche jou chun Midian mite le Amalek mite chuleh solam mipite ho chu apangkhom’un Israel te sat dingin Jordan vadung ahung galkaiyun Jezreel phaicham achun akikhom uvin ngahmun akisem tauvin ahi.  
\v 34 Hichun Pakai Lhagao chu Gideon chunga apansa tan ahi. Aman saki a kisem sumkon chu amut in galsat ding mi akou khomin ahileh Abiezer phung miho chu ama kom'ah ahung tauvin ahi.  
\v 35 Aman thupo miho chu asolin Manasseh, Asher, Zebulun leh Naphtali galsat ding miho chu aga kousah in ahileh amaho abonchan ahung kon tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Hichun Gideon Pathen hengah ataovin, “Nangin na-na sei banga keima hi Israel te jouse huhdoh dinga nei manchah mong-mong ding ahileh,  
\v 37 hiti chun nei hetchet sah in, keiman tujan tengleh amulnei kelngoivun hi changvohna phol chunga kakoi ding ahi. Hiche kelngoi vun hi jingkah tengleh daitwi ana chapnou inlang amavang tol hi anagot a ahileh nasei banga chu Israel te hi huhdohna dinga nei manchah got ahi ti ka hetchetna ding hihen,” ati.  
\v 38 Hitobang chet chun thil chu ana sohdoh tan ahi. Ajing jingkah chun Gideon matah in athoudoh in kelngoi vun chu aheh a ahileh twi khon khat dimset ahungdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Chujou chun Gideon'in Pathen kom'ah hitin asei kit’e, “Nei lunghan hihbeh in, thil khat kathumbe nom nalaije. Hiche kelngoi vun hi mangcha a hetchetna khat neipehbe nahlai ding kadeije. Tuchung hin hiche kelngoi vun hi gotsah inlang, avel'a tol hi daitwi ana chetsah in,” atin ahi.  
\v 40 Hiche jan jong chun Pathen’in Gideon ngeh bang chun ana bolpeh kit in, kelngoi vun agotsah in chule tollhang bou chu daitwi in ana chapkot in ahi.   
\c 7  
\s1 Gideon'in Midian Mite Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Jerub-baal (Gideon tina) leh asepai te matah in athouvun Herod twinah chan geiyin ache tauvin ahi. Midian sepai te chu amaho sahlang Moreh lhang kom'a phaicham'a ngahmun ana kisem'un ahi.  
\v 2 Pakaijin Gideon kom'a aseijin, “Nangin galsat ding mi natam pui behseh e. Keiman na boncha uvin Midian te gal nasatsah uleng, Israel miten keiho thahatna a kaki huhdoh u ahi, tin Keima dounan hung kiletsah get un nate,  
\v 3 Hijeh chun mipite jah achun koi hileh kichatna neiho sesen hiche mol hi dalhau henlang a incheh uva che tauhen tin seipeh in,” ati. Hiti chun alah uva 22,000 chu inlanga acheuvin, galsat ding ngapcha a mi 10,000 bou adalha tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 7:3 \xt Danbu Ni Na 20:8\x*   
\p
\v 4 Ahin Pakaijin Gideon aseipeh kit in, “Tun jong atam behseh nalaiye hijeh chun don ding twikhuh a puisuh inlang hiche mun a chu keiman nache khompi ding ho leh nache khompi louding miho kahin lhenkhen ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 5 Gideon'in mipi ho chu twikhuh phunga apuisuh phatnin Pakaijin hitin ahin seipeh in ahi, “Mipi ho chu loi-ni in homkhen inlang loikhat chu akhut nia twi soh a uicha banga aleija le-tho ho hi ding, loikhat chu akhupma dilsua amuh a chiptho ho hi ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 6 Mi 300 in bou akhut tenia kon'in adontho uvin ahi. Adangse chu akhupmin adilsu uvin amuh in achip tho uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Pakaijin Gideon kom'ah ahin aseijin, “Hiche mi 300 ho hi kipuijin Keiman na huhdoh ingting Midian ho chu nagajo ding’u ahi, midang ho jouse chu a inlang cheh uva soltan,” ati.  
\v 8 Hijeh chun Gideon'in midang ho neh le chah chuleh saki sumkon apoh hou chu achom khom’in, hiti chun adangse chu a inlanga asoltan ahi. Amavang mi 300 bouseh chutoh aum tan ahi.  
\p Midian ho chun Gideon umna noi phaicham'a chun ngahmun asem tauvin ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche jan chun Pakaijin hitin aseije, “Kipat inlang Midian ngahmun'a gachesuh in, ajeh chu amaho chunga hi galjona kamusah ding nahi!  
\v 10 Ahinlah amaho gasat ding hi nakichat a ahileh na lhacha Purah chu kipuijin angahmun uvah gachesuh lhon'in,  
\v 11 Midian ten ipi asei uvam ga ngailhi lechun nangma na kitilkhou chom lheh ding ahi, hiteng chuleh nangin amaho gasat ding chu ngapcha tan nate,” ati.  
\p Hijeh chun Gideon'in Purah chu akipuijin gal miho ngahmun komcha achun achesuh lhon tan ahi.  
\v 12 Midian mite le Amalek mite chuleh solam mite sepai ho chu hiche phaicham'a chun khaokhote alomchang lah bangin atam a tam ana pansa uvin ahi. Asangan hou jong chu twikhanglen panga neldi jat bangin sim a sim joulou jat ana phauvin ahi.  
\v 13 Alah uva mikhat chun aloipa kom'ah amang ahin seijin ahileh Gideon chun hichu ajah phahna dingin agah kithol lut in ahi. Hiche pa chun hitin ahin seije, “Keiman mangkhat kana neijin kamang’a chun sakol chaang a kisem changlhah lumkhat Midian te ponbuh geiyin ahung kilih suh peh in, hichun ponbuh hi ahin tat khan akhup athal'in akileh jengin chujouvin akiphamat deh jengin ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun aloipa chun hitin adonbutnin, “Namang chun thil khat adoi aum'e Pathen’in Israel mi Joash chapa Gideon hi Midian mite le apan khompiho jouse chung’a hi galjona apeh ahitai!” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Gideon in hiche mang akiledohna thucheng chu ajah phatnin Pakai ang’a abohkhup in chibai aboh tan ahi. Hiche jou chun Israel te ngahmun’ah ahung kilekit in kho asam tan ahi, “Kipatdoh un Pakaijin Midian mite le akiloikhompi chengse chung’a hi galjona eipeh u ahitai!” ati.  
\v 16 Hiti chun Gideon'in a sepai 300 chu loi thum'in ahomin mikhat cheh chu saki sumkon khat cheh leh leibel khat cheh asunga meisel um cheh toh apehtha in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche jou chun Gideon'in ajah uvah hitin aseije, “Namit teni uvin keima neihinve jingun, amaho ngahmun kom kalhun tengleh keiman kabol bol hinbol'un.  
\v 18 Kei le kalhonpi kaloi hon saki sumkon kahin mut tengu leh, ngahmun kimvel jousea konna nang hon jong sumkon nahin mut sohkei uva nahoh diu, ‘Pakai ding le Gideon dingin’ tin hinsam cheh un!” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Jan khangkim jou panmun ngahho kikhel jou pettah chun Gideon leh aloi mi jakhat chu Midian te ngahmun komcha chu agalhung tauvin ahi. Photlot tah in ama hon saki sumkon chu amut un leibel chu avokeh tauvin ahi.  
\v 20 Hiche jou chun loithum ho cheng chun asumkon cheh u amut un aleibel cheh u jong avokeh tauvin ahi. Ama hon ameisel'u kong leiloi chu akhut veilamin achoijun chuleh jetlangin asumkon uchu achoijun ahoh cheh un, “Pakai chemjam ding leh Gideon dingin” tin hasap in asam'un ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Ngahmun kimvel achun abonchauvin ama-ama dinmun cheh a chun dettah in adingun ahileh, Midian mite chu tijatah in apentoh akatoh ajamtoh atho tauvin ahi.  
\v 22 Israel mi 300 in saki sumkon chu amut cheh phat un Pakaijin ngahmun sunga um galsat dia kigong miho chu achemjam un amaho leh amaho akisatto sah tan ahi. Akisatlih lou chengse chu Zererah kom Beth-shittah chan gei leh Tabbath kom Abel-meholah gamgi geijin ajamlut tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hijou chun Gideon'in, Nephtali le Asher chuleh Manasseh sepaiho akou khomin Midian mite gal jamho chu adelpeh un ahi.  
\v 24 Gideon'in Ephraim thinglhang gamsung muntin a thupole ho asolin hiti hin aga seisah in ahi, “Hung konsuh unlang Midian te hung satnun Beth-barah mun Jordan vadung paltanna mun'ah amaho hi hung ting tan’un,” ati.  
\p Hijeh chun Ephraim mite jousen akisei bangin atongdoh sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 25 Ama hon, Midian mite gal lamkai teni Oreb le Zeeb chu amanun, Oreb chu Oreb songpi munnah athatnun chuleh Zeeb chu Zeeb lengpithei hehna munnah athatnun ahi. Chuleh Midian te chu ana nungdel peh un ahi. Hiche jou chun Israel ten Oreb leh Zeeb luchang teni chu Jordan vadung gal lam'a Gideon kom'a chun ahin polut un ahi.   
\c 8  
\s1 Gideon in Zebah le Zalmunna atha lhon  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jouhin Ephraim mipi ten Gideon adong'un, “Ipi dinga hitia hi neibollu ham? Midian te sat dinga nahung kijot uva chu ipi dinga neina kou louvu ham?” atiuvin; lungnatah in Gideon chu ana kinelpi uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Ahin Gideon'in adonbutnin, “Nangho toh tekah dinga ken ipi katohdoh beh am? Ephraim min lengpithei alolhah jouva amoh akhen hou chu Abiezer phungbah neocha ho lhosohga pumpi sanga tamjo hilou ham?  
\v 3 Pathen’in Midian gal lamkai teni Oreb le Zeeb chunga galjona napeh toh tekah thei dinga ken ipi katohdoh beh am? ati. Ephraim mihon Gideon thusei chu ajah phat un alunghan nau adailha tai. \x + \xo 8:3 \xt Labu 83:11\x*   
\s1 Gideon In Midian te Leng Ana Matdoh  
\p
\v 4 Gideon'in amite 300 toh Jordan vadung ahin pal galkaijun ahi, athachol lheh jeng vangun agal miteu chu ana del nalaijun ahi.  
\v 5 Succoth alhun phat un Gideon'in akhopi lamkaiho kom'ah “Ka sepai te ho dingin anneh themkhat beh neipeuvin amaho hi athachol lheh tauvin ahi. Keiman Midian lengte Zebah leh Zalmunna kahin del ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Ahinlah Succoth lamkai ten adonbut’un, “Zebah le Zalmunna chu hin man masauvin chujou teng keihon na sepai te vah nauvinge” atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche phat chun Gideon'in ajah uvah, “Pakaijin Zebah le Zalmunna chunga galjona eipeh uva kahung kile lam tengleh gammang noiya konna kahin lah ling le molla natahsau kajep teldeh ding nahiuve,” atitan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichea kon'in Gideon chu Peniel langah ache touvin amaho kom'a jong chun neh ding an athum’in ahileh ama hon jong hitobang machun ana donbut un ahi.  
\v 9 Hijeh chun aman jong amaho kom'a chun, “Gal kahin joa kahung kile teng hiche intingvum hi kaloi chim ding ahi” atipeh tai.   
\p
\v 10 Hiche pet hin Zebah leh Zalmunna chu Karkor munnah sepai 15,000 toh aum khom lhon'in ahi, hicheng ho chu solam gamkaija pangkhom sepai 1,20,000 ana kithat holah a amoh ho cheng chu ahiuve.  
\v 11 Gideon'in Nobah le Jogbehah solam mi kiveiho lampi chu akolin aum kimvelin, chuin Midian sepai te chu kigingman louvin adelkhum tan ahi.  
\v 12 Midian leng teni Zebah leh Zalmunna ana jam lhon'in ahin, Gideon'in adelsuh peh in asepai te jouse toh amattha tan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hiche jou chun Gideon chu agalsat munna kon chun ahung kile in Heres lampi chu ahin jotnin ahi.  
\v 14 Hichea chun Succoth a konna hung gollhang khat amanin akhopi sunga thunei vaihom ho leh lamkai upa somsagi le sagi ho min chu ajihdoh soh tan ahi.  
\v 15 Gideon chu Succoth lang’ah akile in alamkai hou kom'a chun hitin aseitan ahi, “Tuhin Zebah le Zalmunna chu hikom'ah aumtai, tumasanga nakom uva kahung chun nang hon noise tah in Zebah leh Zalmunna chu hin man masauvin chutengleh na sepai te thachol chu vah nauvinge natiuvin ahi.  
\v 16 Hijou chun Gideon'in akhopi lamkaiho chu gammang noija ahinlah ling le mol chun ajepmin hilchahna anei tan ahi.  
\v 17 Aman Peniel intingvum jong chu avochim’in hiche khopi sunga umho jouse chu athat gam tan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hijou chun Gideon'in Zebah leh Zalmunna chu adongin “Tabor munna natha hou chu itobang mi hiuvam?” ati.  
\p Amanin adonbut lhonin “Nang tobang ahiuve, ama ho chun leng cha hina lim le mel apu cheh uve,” ati lhon'in ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun aman jong, “Amaho chu kasopi pasal ho ahiuvin, keima kanu tah chate jeng ahiuve,” ati. Chujouvin Gideon'in, “Hingjing Pakai minna kasei ahi, amaho chu ana that hih leu chun tunia hi nangni katha lhon louding ahi,” tin asaptho jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Chuin Gideon akiheiyin achapa atahpenpa Jethar kom'a chun, “Kipat inlang ani lhon'in that tan” ati. Ahin Jether chu chapangcha ahijeh in akichan achemjam asatdoh ngam tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Zebah leh Zalmunna chun Gideon kom'ah asei lhon'in, “Pasal nahina tah langin, nangma tah in nei that jeng lhon'in,” ati lhon'in ahi. Hichun, Gideon'in amani chu athat in asangongsang ngong lhon’a thil mantam ho chu akilah tan ahi.   
\s1 Gideon In Ompho Asem Chule Athi  
\p
\v 22 Hichun Israel ten Gideon kom'a chun “Nang le na chate chuleh natute chan geijin kachung uvah vaihomin pang tauvin ajeh chu nangin Midian te a kon'in nei huhdoh tauvin ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 23 Ahin Gideon'in adonbut in, “Kei kahin ka chate ahin nachung uva vaihom pouvinge, Pakai joh in nachung uva vai ahom ding ahi.  
\v 24 Ahinlah keiman thil khat kathum nom'e, nang ho mikhat cheh in galmi natha houva konna nahin chomdoh u bilba chu neipe uvin,” ati. (Gal miho chu Ishmael te ahijeh un sana bilba akiba cheh u ahi).   
\p
\v 25 Ama hon kipah tah in aseijun, “Peuvinge” atiuve. Hiti chun amaho khat cheh in, galla ahin chomdoh lah uva kon'in sana bilba ho chu pon aphauvin aseplha sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 26 Hiche sana bilba ho chu pounds somli le thum aphan ahi, hichea panglou galla ahin chomdoh u adang ho chu, lengte kijepna thil mantam ho, Midian leng ten akivon'u ponsandup ho leh asangongsao hou ngonga a-opeh u thil mantamho jouse jong ahi nalaiye.   
\p
\v 27 Gideon'in hiche sana hoa kon chun ompho asemin ama khopi Ophrah munna akoiyin ahi. Ahinla gangtah in Israel ten hichu ahin hou un kisuhboh nan aneiyun, hichu Gideon le a insung mite dingin kipalna in ahung pangtai.   
\p
\v 28 Hiti hin Israel ten Midian te chu ana sunem’un ahileh hiche kah chu Midian te akiledoh jou tapouvin ahi. Hichea kon chun Gideon hinlai sunga kum somli sungin gamsung’ah chamna alengin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Hiche jou chun Joash chapa Gideon chu a inlanga akile tan ahi.  
\v 30 Aman chapa som sagi aneijin ahi, ajeh chu amahin ji tamtah anei jeh ahi.  
\v 31 Aman Shechem mun a thaikem khat ana neijin, amanu chun chapa khat ahinpeh in amin Abimelech ahi.  
\v 32 Gideon athi chun ateh lheh jeng tan ahi, ama chu Abiezer phung mite gamsunga um Ophrah mun'ah apa Joash lhankhuh a ana vui tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Gideon thijou jouvin Israel te chu amaho leh amaho akisuboh un Baal chu pathen’in akisem'un Baal doilim semthu ho chu ana houvun ahi.  
\v 34 Ama hon avel uva cheng agal mite jouseuva konna ahin huhdoh uva a Pakai a Pathen'u chu asumil tauvin ahi.  
\v 35 Ama hon Israel mite dinga thilpha tamtah ana tongdoh a Jerub-baal kitipa Gideon insung mite jeng jong jana leh gelkhohna imacha ana nei tapouvin ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 Abimelech In Shechem Chung’a Vai Ahop  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat hi Gideon chapa Abimelech chu Shechem ache in, apupa hichu anu sopipa chu gavil dingin achen ahi. Aman amaho leh anu insungmi adang ho jah a chun hitin aseije,  
\v 2 “Shechem khomite lah a lamkai ho kom'ah Gideon chate som sagi hon nachung uva vai ahom ding nadei uvam ahilouleh mikhat in vai ahom ding nadei joh uvam tin dongun ana tin ahi. Chuleh keima hi na thisan uleh naphe navou u kahi ti geldoh un” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hiti chun Abimelech pute hon ama thakhellin Shechem mite ho chu ana dongun ahi. Hiche thu hi Shechem mite hon giltah a agel jouvun Abimelech chu akinaipiu ahijeh in achung uva vaihom dingin alheng tauvin ahi.  
\v 4 Hijeh chun ama hon Baal-berith Hou-In a kon'in dangka somsagi anape uvin, hichu mangcha in aman miduhdahlou mi phabep anungjui dingin akisemin ahi.  
\v 5 Chujouvin Abimelech chu Ophrah khopia apa insunga ache in, songkhat mangchan asopite Gideon chapa somsagi chu agathat gamtan ahi. Ahin uchaho lah a aneopen Jotham chu jamdoh in ana kiseldoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hiche jou chun Shechem leh Beth-millo khomite lah a lamkai ho chu Shechem khompi kom gangpi phung noijah akikhom'un Abimelech chu leng achansah tauve.   
\s1 Jotham In Thulem Asei  
\p
\v 7 Jotham’in hiche hi ajahdoh phat in Gerizim molchung vum'ah akaldoh in kho ahin samtan ahi,  
\b  
\q1 “Shechem khocheng mite ho ka thusei hi ngaijuvin!  
\q2 Pathen'in na thuseiju angai ding nadei uleh ka thusei hi nei ngaipeh un!   
\q1
\v 8 Phat khatnin thingphung hon alengpau ding alheng gouvin  
\q2 amasapen in Olive thingphung kom'ah aseijun,  
\q1 ka lengpau dingin nei panpeh un atiuve!   
\q1
\v 9 Ahinlah Olive thingphung anompon, hitin aseijin ahi,  
\q2 'Keiman Olive thao kaputdoh sah a  
\q2 Pathen le mihem te kakipasahji hi kangah a,  
\q2 iti thingphung dang ho chunga vai kagahom ding ham? ati.   
\b  
\q1
\v 10 Chujouvin theichang phung kom'a agaseijun,  
\q2 nangma ka lengpa uvin hung pang tan agati uve!.   
\q1
\v 11 Ahinlah theichang phung chu ana nompon hitin ahin seije,  
\q1 ‘Keiman theichang lhumkei kagadoh sah hi ka dalhah a  
\q2 hiche thingphung holah a hi iti kaga vaihom ding ham?’ ati.   
\b  
\q1
\v 12 Hiche jou chun lengpithei phung kom'a agaseijun  
\q1 ka lengpa uvin hung pang tan agatiuve,   
\q1
\v 13 Ahinlah lengpithei phung chu ana nompon hiti hin ahin seije,  
\q2 ‘Keiman Pathen leh mihemte kakipasahna  
\q1 hiche twilhum ka putdoh sah hi kangah a  
\q2 iti hiche thingphungho chunga hi kaga vaihom ding ham ana tin ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 14 Ajona in thingphung jouse chu acheuvin lingphung kom'ah  
\q2 hungin lang ka lengpa uvin hung pang tan agatiuve.   
\q1
\v 15 Hiche lingphung chun thingho kom'ah hitin ahin seije,  
\q1 “Nanghon keima hi na leng uva neitun nom uleh,  
\q2 hungun lang kalimnoija hin hung kisel tauvin,  
\q1 achuti louleh keija kon'in mei hung kongdoh intin  
\q2 Lebanon a um Cedar thingphung jouse akahvam ding ahi,” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 16 Jotham'in aseiben, “Tun nang hon Abimelech chu na lengpau dinga natun uhi lungtheng tah leh bolding lomtah a nabol'u hinam chuleh Gideon leh achilhah te chunga hi them nachan diu hinam? Aman atohdoh ho chunga ahi ding bangtah a jana le hetpehna achan ding doltah nachan sah u hinam?  
\v 17 Ajeh chu aman ahinkho phal ngam’a nangho Midian te a konna na huhdoh u ahi.  
\v 18 Ahinlah tunin nang hon kapa leh achilhah ho chungah khan gitlouna nasatah nabol'un achate somsagi jen chu songkhat mangchan nathat tauvin ahi. Hiti chun asoh numeinu chapa Abimelech chu nasopiu ahijeh in na lengpa uvin natung tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Tunia na natoh uhi Gideon chung le achilhah ho chunga lungtheng tah le jana neitah a natoh u ahileh Abimelech chungah nang hon kipana mu uvin chuleh aman jong nangho chungah kipana muhen.  
\v 20 Amavang nang hon lungtheng tah a nabol'u ahilouleh vang Abimelech a kon'in mei hung kongdoh henlang Shechem leh Beth-millo a chengho lah a lamkaiho jouse vallhum hen, chuleh Shechem leh Beth-millo a chenghoa kon'in mei hung koudoh henlang Abimelech vallhum hen,” tin anasam in ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hiche jou chun Jotham ajamdoh in, asopipa Abimelech akichat jeh in Beer ah agacheng tai.   
\s1 Shechem In Abimelech Adou  
\p
\v 22 Abimelech hin Israel te chung’a kum thum lhingset vai anapo in ahi.  
\v 23 Pathen’in lhagao khat ahinsol'in Abimelech leh Shechem khomite lamkai ho kikah a kiboina asodoh sah tan, hichun amaho akiphin tauve.  
\v 24 Abimelech chu Gideon chapa sagi atha jeh chuleh Shechem a cheng hon Abimelech in asopiho atha chu ana tosot jeh un Pathen’in amaho chu gotna apetan ahi.  
\v 25 Hichun Shechem khomi ten Abimelech chu molchunga achaanglhi uvin hilanga cheho jouse chu ana chom’un ahi. Ahin hitobang atohgot uchu mikhat in Abimelech henga aga seipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Nikhat hi Ebed chapa Gaal kitipa chu Shechem a asopi hotoh achaolut uvin ahileh, akhomite lamkai hon ama chu atahsan jotauvin ahi.  
\v 27 Shechem’a kumlhun neh le chah kikhol khom phatna kimang golvah chu akhomun'a cheng ten semthu pathen ahounau hou-in achun amangun ahi. Lengpithei twi chu nengtah alon jing pettah chun mijousen Abimelech chu asamse-asamse jeng tauvin ahi.  
\v 28 “Abimelech hi koi hija ham?” tin Gaal kitipa chun asamtan ahi. “Ama chu Shechem cha tahbeh ahipoi” ahileh ama lhacha kin ibola itoh diu ham? Ama chu Gideon cha bou ahin chuleh Zebul hi ama noidoupa mai-mai ahi bouve, Shechem phutdohpa Hamor chapa tahbeh ho kinbou ibol diu ahi, ipi dinga Abimelech lhacha na itoh diu ham?  
\v 29 Keima hi hilai mun'a vaipo hileng Abimelech hi ka suhmang ding ahi. Keiman ama kom'ah sepai phabep hin kipuijin chuleh hungin lang kisatto hite kati ding ahi,” tin Gaal in ana samtan ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Ahin Zebul hiche khopia lamkaipa chun Gaal thusei chu ajahdoh phatnin alunghang lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 31 Hichun aman Arumah a um Abimelech kom'a chun thupole ho khat asol'in hiti hin aseije, “Ebed chapa Gaal leh asopite chu Shechem’a cheng dingin ahungin, tun ama hon khopi mitehi nangma dou dingin atildoh tan ahi.  
\v 32 Na sepai te toh janin hungin lang loujao dunga khun hung kisel inlang,  
\v 33 jingkah kho ahungvah vah leh khopi hi hin bulu jengin, Gaal leh aloiho nangma dou dia kisaho se-se chunga chu nangman nadei deija nabol thei ahitai” ati.   
\p
\v 34 Hijeh chun Abimelech leh amite jouse janin acheuvin loili in akihom khen'un Shechem chu aum tauvin ahi.  
\v 35 Abimelech le asepai te chu akisel nauva konna ahung potdoh phat chun Gaal chu khopi kelkot achun ana dingin ahi.  
\v 36 Gaal chun amaho chu amu phatnin Zebul kom'ah ahin seije, “Ven molvum'a kon'in mihonpi phabep ahungsuh uve” ati.  
\p Zebul chun ahin donbutnin “Hichu thinglhanga thil le ho pou chu mihem lim'a namu khattou hinte” ati.   
\p
\v 37 Ahinlah Gaal chun aseikit in, “Ahipoi mol'a kon khun mipi phabep ahungsuh in ahi” atikit in ahi, chuleh loi chomkhat jong doi kisanna gangpi phung galkaina lampia kon jong khun ahung suh uve,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Hichun Zebul chun ama lam ahin nga’n ahin donbutnin ahi. “Tua hi nakam'a na nop-nop nasei chu hoilang geija hitam? Abimelech koi ham, eihon ama kin ipi dinga ibol dinguh am nati hilou ham? Nangin na houset ho chu tun khopi pam'a aum uve! Potdoh inlang gakisatpi tan,” atipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Hijeh chun Gaal in Shechem khomite lamkai ho chu Abimelech toh kisat dingin apuitan ahi.  
\v 40 Ahinlah Abimelech chun Gaal ahin dellin, chuleh Shechem mite tamtah chu akisukha un, chule khopi kelkot langa hunglejam ho chu alhukaam tauvin ahi.  
\v 41 Abimelech chu Arumah langah akile tan, Zebul chun Gaal leh asopi ho chu anodoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Ajing chun Shechem mipite chu galsat dingin ahung kondoh kit tauvin ahi. Abimelech chun hichu ajahdoh phatnin,  
\v 43 amite chu loithum’in ahom khennin loujaovah amaho chu achaanglhi tauvin ahi. Abimelech in Shechem mipi te ho chu akhopi uva konna ahung kondoh amudoh phat in, amaho jong akisel nauva kon'in ahung potdoh un akisatpi tauvin ahi.  
\v 44 Abimelech loihon khopi kelkot chu anokhum un Shechem mite chu ahunglelut kit theilouna diuvin akhahtan tauvin ahi. Langkhat ah Abimelech mite loini kihomkhen chun phaileijah amaho chu anasat chap jengun ahi.  
\v 45 Nilhum keijin akisatnun ajona in Abimelech chun khopi chu alatan ahi. Aman mipi ho chu athat gamin khopi chu asuchimin toljang pumpi chu chi asokhum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 46 Khosung chengho lah a lamkaiho Shechem inting vumma chengho chun thilsoh ho chu ajah phat un ajam’un Baal doi houna in a chun alut un akisel tauvin ahi.  
\v 47 Mikhatnin Shechem khomi lamkai ho chu asemthu pathen houna insunga akisel uve ti Abimelech chu agaseipeh phat nin,  
\v 48 asepai te chu Zalmon Mol langa apuitou tan ahi, aman heicha khat alan thingboh ho chu atulhan alengkouva akiput in ahi. Chuin aman amite jah ah “Gangtah in keibol tobang hin bollun,” ati.  
\v 49 Hiti chun abonchauvin thingbah chu akisatnun Abimelech bol tobang chun abolsoh tauvin ahi. Ama hon thingbah ho chu a hou-in bang chunga chun asekhom'un meiyin ahal khum tauvin ahi. Hichun Shechem inting vumma um mipi jouse chu athigam tan ahi. Amaho chu numei pasal agomin mi sangkhat ahiuve.   
\p
\v 50 Hiche ban chun Abimelech in Thebez khopi chu anokhum in alatan ahi.  
\v 51 Ahinlah khopi sunga chun intingvum lhoutah khat aumin, khopi sunga mipite jouse chu numei pasal abonchauvin hiche mun achun ajamlut tauvin ahi. Amaho leh amaho kot akikam khum'un intingvum chung vum'a akaldoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 52 Abimelech in amaho chu ajuilut in intingvum a chun nokhum agon ahi. Ahinlah aman alutnau mun chu gahhal ding agot laitah in,  
\v 53 numei khatnin inchung dan a konna sumhei songkhat ahin seplhan ahileh Abimelech luchanga chun achun alugu chu asepkeh tan ahi. \x + \xo 9:53 \xt 2 Samuel 11:21\x*   
\p
\v 54 Aman agal manchah poa gollhangpa kom'a chun gangtah in “Na chemjam satdoh loijin lang neihin thatnin, achuti louleh min numei khatnin Abimelech athattai tiget inte,” ahi. Hichun gollhangpa chun Abimelech chu ana sunlih tai.  
\v 55 Abimelech miten ama chu athitai ti amudoh phat un akikhen tellun a incheh uvah akile tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 56 Hiti hin Abimelech in apa douna a asopite somsagi ana tha jeh chun Pathen’in achunga phu ana latan ahi.  
\v 57 Shechem mipite jong chu thilse abol jeh un Pathen’in achung uva phu alatan ahi. Hiti chun Gideon chapa Jotham in agaosapna chu aguilhung tan ahi.   
\c 10  
\s1 Tola Israel te Thutan Vaihom'a Apan  
\p
\v 1 Abimelech thijou hin Dodo chapa Puah chapa Tola hi Israel te huhdoh dingin ahung pangin ahi. Ama hi Issachar phungmi ahin, Ephraim thinglhang gamsunga um Shamir khopia cheng mi ahi.  
\v 2 Ama hi kum somni le thum sungin Israel te lah a thutan vaihom’in ana pangin ahi. Ama athi phatnin Shamir munnah ana kivuijin ahi.   
\s1 Jair Israel te Thutan Vaihom'a Apan  
\p
\v 3 Tola athijou hin Gilead a kon'in Jair in kum somni le ni sungin Israel te thutan vaihom in ana pange.  
\v 4 Chapa somthum aneijin, amaho chun sangan somthum ana mangcha uvin chuleh ama hin Gilead gamsung'ah khopi somthum ma ana neijun ahi, hiche ho chu tuni chan geijin Jair khopi ho akitin ahi.  
\v 5 Jair athi phatnin Kamon khopia ana vuijun ahi.   
\s1 Ammon Miten Israel Mite Abol Genthei  
\p
\v 6 Avellin Israel ten Pakai mitmun thilse jeng anabol kitnun ahi. Ama hon Baal le Ashtoreth milim doi semthu ana hou kitnun chule Aram, Sidon, Moab, Ammon chule Philistine te semthu pathen ana houvun ahi. Ama hon Pakai chu ana nuse uvin hou din jong ana gotapouvin ahi.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun Pakai chu Israel chungah nasatah in ana lunghang tan ahileh amaho chu Philistine te le Ammon mite khut ah ana pedoh tan ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche kum apat chun ana sugenthei lheh jengun ahi. Ama hon Gilead gamsunga um Amor mite gam solam gamkaija cheng Israel te jouse chungah kum som le get sungin ana sugentheijun ahi.  
\v 9 Ammon miten Jordan lhumlam ajong ahung galkaijun Judah, Benjamin chuleh Ephraim ho jong ahung bulu jiuvin ahi.  
\p Hiti chun Israel te hin agenthei nau chu ana thohlel lheh jeng tauvin ahi.  
\v 10 Athohlel behseh phat un Pakai kom'ah panpi ngaichatna in ana kapjah jengun, “Pakai keiho nangma dounan kana chonse lheh jeng tauve, ajeh chu keihon ka Pathen'u nangma kana nuse uvin Baal doi semthu milimho kana hou tauve” atiuve.   
\p
\v 11 Pakaijin ahin donbutnin, “Keiman nangho hi Egypt mite a kon, Amor mite a kon, Ammon kite a kon chule Phileistinete te a konna kana huhdoh nahilou uham?  
\v 12 Sidon mite Amalek mite leh Maon mite a konna jong kana huhdoh u hilou ham? Ama hon nabol genthei tengu leh panpi ngehna a nahung kajah jeng jiuva keiman kana huhdoh jiu hilou ham?   
\p
\v 13 Ahiyeng vang'in nang hon Keima einuse jiuva semthu pathen dang ho joh nahou jiu hilou ham? Hijeh chun Keiman nangho huhdoh tapou vinge,  
\v 14 Cheuvin lang nang hon na deilhen joh u semthu pathen ho joh kom'ah gakap unlang na hahsat nauva kon hin kihuhdoh sah tauvin” atipeh joh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Ahinlah Israel te Pakai kom'a atao tei-tei jengun hitin aseijun ahi, “Pakai keiho kachonse tauve nangin nadei dan danin nei engbol tauvin ahinla ka galmi teuva kon'in tunin nei huhdoh tei-tei jun,” atiuve.  
\v 16 Hijou chun Israel ten gamdang semthu pathen ho chu apaimangun Pakai joh chu ahou tauve. Hichun Israel te gimna chu avet a ahileh Pakai jong alung ahimo lheh jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche pettah chun Ammon sepai te galsat dingin akikhom uvin, Gilead gamsunga chun panmun akisem un ahi, chuleh Israel te jong akikhom khom uvin Mizpah mun'ah chun a panmun diu ana kisem un ahi.  
\v 18 Gilead lamkaiho chu khat le khat akihou som'un, “Koi hileh Ammon mite sat masa pen-pen chu Gilead mite chunga vaihom'in pang jeng hen” atiuvin ahi.   
\c 11  
\s1 Jepthah Israel te Thutan Vaihom'a Ahungpan  
\p
\v 1 Tun Gilead gam'a cheng Jepthah chu gal hattah anahi. Ama hi Gilead chapa ahin amavang anu chu numei noti anahi.  
\v 2 Gilead jinu chun chapa phabep ana neijin ahi, ama ho ahung khanlet phat un ama hon Jepthah chu agam uva kon'in ana nodoh un ahi. Ama hon Jepthah kom'ah, “Nangin ipau gou hi nachan thei louding ahi, ajeh chu nang hi numei chavai noti khat cha nahi bouve atiuvin ahi.  
\v 3 Hijeh chun Jepthah chu asopi hoa kon'in ana jamdoh in Tob gam'ah ana chengin ahi. Gangtah in aman anungjui ding loi phabep ahin nei paitan ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche phatlai hin, Ammon miten Israel te chungah gal ahin boltan ahi.  
\v 5 Ammon miten ahin nokhum phat uhin, Gilead lamkai ten Tob a um Jepthah hi akou tauvin ahi.  
\v 6 Hiche lamkai ho hin aseijun ahi, “Hungin lang keiho lamkaijin hung pangtan! Ammon mite toh kisatna ding ahin neihung panpi uvin!” atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Ahin Jepthah chun amaho kom'ah, “Nanghon nei vetda uva kapa in a konna neina nodoh u hilou ham? Tua hahsatna nanei phat uva hi ipi dinga kakom'a nahungu ham?” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Lamkaiho chun adonbutnun “Ajeh chu tua hi nangma ka ngaichat u ahitai, nangman Ammon mite toh kisattona a hi neihung lamkai uva ahileh keihon Gilead mite jouse chunga lamkaija kapan sah dingu ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 9 Jepthah in lamkaiho kom'a chun hitin aseije, “Keima kahunga Pakaijin Ammon mite chunga chu gal eijosah a ahileh na lamkai uva nei pansah mong diu hinam?” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Lamkai hon adonbut un, “Pakai chu ichung uva ahetoh in pangjing hen nangin nasei chan chu bol dinga kakitep u ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 11 Hiti chun Jepthah chu Gilead lamkaiho toh akilhon khom tauvin ahi, chuleh Gilead mipite chun alamkai diuvin apansah tauvin chule gal lamkai jong ahisah tauve.  
\v 12 Hiche jou chun Jepthah in thupole ho Ammon lengpa kom'a asolin hitin aseije, “Ibola ka gamsunga hi galbol dinga nahung ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Ammon lengpan Jepthah thupole ho kom'ah hitin ahin sei uvin ahi, “Israel te Egypt a konna ahungu chun, ama hon kagam'u, Arnon vadunga kon'in Jabbok vadung gei chuleh Jordan chan geijin eilahpeh un ahi. Tun chamna nadei leh hiche ho chu neihin nungpeh tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Jepthah in thupole ho chu Ammon lengpa kom'a alesol kitnin aseije:   
\b  
\pmo
\v 15 Hiche hi Jepthah in asei chu ahi, “Israel ten Moab ahin Ammon mite ahin agam'u kalahpeh pouve.  
\v 16 Israel mipite Egypt a konna ahung kitoldoh uva Twipi San ahung galkai jou uchun Kadesh ahunglhungun,  
\v 17 ama hon Edom lengpa kom'a agamsung ahin phalpeh pouvin ahi. Hiche jou chun Moab lengpa kom'a hiche tobang machun agah thumkit un ahileh agamsung ahopa ding chu ahin janom dehpon ahi. Hijeh chun Israel mipite chu Kadesh a akinga tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 11:17 \xt Minbu 20:14-21\x*   
\pm
\v 18 Akhonna in Edom le Moab chu apellun gamthip noija akitol tauvin ahi. Ama hon Moab solam gamgi lang chu ajot un Arnon Vadung pang tenia chun ngahmun asem tauvin ahi. Ahinla ama hon Moab lutna dingin Arnon Vadung ahin pal galkai khapon ahi, ajeh chu Arnon chu Moab gamgi ahi. \x + \xo 11:18 \xt Minbu 21:4\x*   
\pm
\v 19 Hiche jou chun Israel ten Heshbon a um Amor mi Sihon lengpa kom'ah ajotnau mun athum theina dingun agamsung hopana dinga phalna thumin thupole ho asolin ahi. \x + \xo 11:19 \xt Minbu 21:21-24\x*  
\v 20 Ahinlah Sihon lengpan Israel ten agamsungu ahopa diu ana phal pon ahi. Aman asepai te agongtoh in Jahaz munah amaho chu ana kidoupin ahi.  
\v 21 Ahinlah Pakai Israel te Pathen chun amite chu Sihon lengpa chu ana josah tan ahi. Hijeh chun Israel ten kholang gamkaija um Amor mite gam jouse,  
\v 22 Arnon Vadunga konna Jabbok Vadung chuleh gamthip noi solanga konna Jordan chan gei chungah tha ana neijun ahi.   
\pm
\v 23 Hiti chun Pakai Israel Pathen’in Amor mite gam chu alahpeh a Israel te anapeh ahin hichu keihon iti dan a nangho kanungpeh kit diu ham?  
\v 24 Hijeh chun na pathen u Chemosh in napeuvin napeh uchu kikoi unlang keihon jong Pakai ka Pathen uvin eipeh u gam chu kakoiju ahi bouve.  
\v 25 Nangho Moab lengpa Zippor chapa Balak sanga phajo nahiuvam? Aman Israel te chunga gal anabol khah em? \x + \xo 11:25 \xt Minbu 22:1-6\x*   
\pm
\v 26 Israel hi hiche gam'a hi kum 300 hung chenga ahitan, Heshbon leh avel'a achenna hou Aroer leh achennau gam jouse chule Arnon Vadung vel'a khopiho jouse hi ana chenphau ahitai. Phat hitih chanpi hi ipi dinga nahin nunglah louham?  
\v 27 Hijeh chun keiman nang chungah suhkhel kaneipoi, nangjoh in neihung nokhum jeh a hi kei chunga suhkhel nanei joh ahi, hijeh chun tuni hin ichung uva vaihom'a Pakaijin Israel ham ahilouleh Ammon mite joh themmoa ham ti hin phongdoh jenghen” ati.   
\b  
\m
\v 28 Ahinlah Ammon lengpan Jepthah thuthot chu anahsah pon ahi.   
\s1 Jepthah Kitepna  
\p
\v 29 Hiche phat chun Pakai lhagao chu Jepthah chungah ahung pansa tan, hichun ama Gilead gam'a kon'in Manasseh chan gei chuleh Gilead sunga Mizpah chan gei agachonin Ammon mite kisatpi dingin sepai aga khom tan ahi.  
\v 30 Jepthah in Pakaiyah kihahselna khat ana neijin hitin ana seijin ahi, “Pakai nangman Ammon mite chunga hi galjona neipeh a ahileh,  
\v 31 Keima gal jouva kakile tengleh ka insunga konna hung potdoh a eihung kimutopi masa pen-pen chu nang kom'a pumgo thilto a dinga katodoh jeng ding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 32 Hiti chun Jepthah in asepai te alamkaijin Ammon mite chu akisatpin ahileh Pakaijin galjona anape tan ahi.  
\v 33 Aman Ammon mite chu Aroer apat Minnith kimvella gamho geijin ana jouvin khopi somni chu analan, Abel-keramim geijin ana suchip jengin ahi. Hiti hin Israel ten Ammon mite chu ana jouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Jepthah chu Mizpah a inmun'a ahung kile phat chun achanu chu lamna a kimang agingthei chaokol chu kibu pumin kipah tah in apa lamto dingin ahung potdoh in ahi. Aman chapa chanu dang aneipon amanu seh-seh chu anei ahi.  
\v 35 Aman achanu chu amu phatnin lungna tah in avonho abottel jengin, “Vo ka chanu!” atin apengjah jengin, “Nangin kalungthim nasuna lheh jengtai, nang hi ipi dinga ka lungthim suna a napan hitam? Ajeh chu keiman Pakai kom'a kihahselna khat kahin nei ahitan, hichea konna chu kaki nunghei theilou ding ahitai,” ati. \x + \xo 11:35 \xt Minbu 30:2\x*   
\p
\v 36 Hichun achanun aseitai, “Hepa nangin Pakai kom'a kihahselna nahin nei ahitah leh nahung kihahselna bang chun ka chungah tongdoh jengin, ajeh chu Pakaijin nagalmi Ammon mite chunga galjona loupitah chu napeh tah chula em.  
\v 37 Ahinlah thil khat vang nei bolsah ding kadeije, Keima nungah thenga thi ding kahitah jeh in lhani sungin kaloi kagol hotoh thinglhang gam'ah gavahle uvingting kakhang donlai pul hi gadou khom uvinge” ati.   
\p
\v 38 Jepthah in, “Gache tan” atin lhani sunga dingin asoldoh tai. Hiti chun ama chu aloi agol chengtoh akhangdonlai pul doukhom dingin ache tauvin ahi.  
\v 39 Achanu chu a inna ahung kile phatnin apan achung changa akihahselna bang chun aboltan ahi. Hiti chun ama chu nungah thengin athitan ahi. Hiche Israel te chonna khatnin ahung umdoh tan ahi.  
\v 40 Israel khangdong nungah hon kumseh leh Jepthah chanu puldouna in nili aga potdoh jiuvin ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Jepthah In Ephraim Chung’a Gal Abol  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jou chun Ephraim mipi hon asepai teu achom khom'un Jordan vadung apal galkaijun Zaphon geijin acheuvin Jepthah kom'ah thupoleho thu athotnun hitin aseijun ahi, “Ammon mite toh kisat dinga nakon uva chu ipi dinga neihin koulou uham? Nang hi na intoh kahallhah tha ding nahi” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Jepthah in amaho chu adonbut in, “Boina ahung kipat chun nangho kahin kou uve, ahinla nangho nahung pouvin ahi!  
\v 3 Hitia hi nangho nahung nomlou kahetdoh phatnin hinkho phalngam in nangho pang louvin galmun ahin kachen Pakaijin Ammon mite chunga hin galjona eipe tan ahi. Ahile tua hi ipi dinga keima to kisat dinga nahung jengu ham?” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangho Gilead mite hi imacha hilou Ephraim le Manesseh a konna jamdoh ho mai-mai nahilou uham?” atiuve. Hijou chun Jepthah in Gilead mite jouse chu aloikhom’in Ephraim mite chu akisatpin ajoutan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Jepthah in Jordan vadung palmun chu alonkhum’in Ephraim’a konna jamdoh khattou chu akinungle a hiche mun hi ahinpal gotleh Gilead miho chun “Ephraim phungmi nahim?” tin adong jiuvin, kahipoi atiuleh,  
\v 6 ama hon “Shibboleth” ti-in atiuvin, ama chu Ephraim mi ahileh “Shibboleth’’ ati diu ahi, ajeh chu Ephraim miten hiche thucheng hi adih a aseitheiji louvu ahi. Hiteng chuleh ama hon apuidoh uva Jordan kaimun’a chu atha jiu ahi. Hiche phat lai chun Ephraim te chu 42,000 ana thatnun ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Jepthah in Israel te chunga ana vaihomna chu kum gup alhingin ahi. Ama athi chun Gilead gamsunga ama khopia anavui un ahi.   
\s1 Ibzan Thutan Vaihom’a Ahungpan  
\p
\v 8 Jepthah thinungin Bethlehem mi Ibzan chun Israel te chungah thutanin ana pangin ahi.  
\v 9 Aman chapa somthum leh chanu somthum ana neijin ahi. Aman achanu te chu ama phungmi hilou hotoh ana kichen sah in, chule achapa te jidingin midang chanute somthum ana kipuilutnin ahi. Ibzan chu Israel te chungah kum sagi thutanin apangin ahi.  
\v 10 Ama athip phatnin Bethlehem'ah ana vuijun ahi.   
\s1 Elon Thutan Vaihom’a Ahungpan  
\p
\v 11 Ibzan thi nungin Zebulun phungmi Elon'in Israel te chunga kum som thutanin ana pangin ahi.  
\v 12 Ama athiphatnin Zebulun gamsunga Aijalon’ah ana vuijun ahi.   
\s1 Abdon Thutan Vaihom’a Ahungpan  
\p
\v 13 Elon thijouvin Pirathon’a kon'in Hillel chapa Abdon’in Israel chunga thutanin ana pange.  
\v 14 Aman chapa somli, tupa somli ana neijin, amaho hi sangan som sagi chunga ana touvun ahi. Ama hi Israel chungah kum get thutanin ana pange.  
\v 15 Ama athi phatnin Amalek te thinglhang gam Ephraim sunga um Pirathon’ah ana vuijun ahi.   
\c 13  
\s1 Samson Pen  
\p
\v 1 Avellin Israel ten Pakai mitmun thilse jeng abol tauvin ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin amaho chu Philistine te khut ah apedoh tauvin ahileh ama hon kum 40 sungin asugenthei lheh jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Hiche nikholai hin Manoah kiti Dan phungmi khat Zorah khopi sungah ana chengin ahi. Ama jinu hin nao avop theipon chanei louvin aum lhon'in ahi.  
\v 3 Pakai vantil khat Manoah jinu kom'ah ahung kilah in hitin aseije, “Nangma chanei thei louhel'in umjong lechun tua hi gangtah a nao nahin vop ding chapa khat nahin ding ahi.  
\v 4 Hijeh chun chingtheijin, nangin ju hihenlang khamnathei dang ipi hijongleh don hihbeh in chuleh neh ding kijahda thil ho chu nehihbeh in.  
\v 5 Nangman nao hinvop in natin chapa khat nahin ding ahi, chuleh asam navopeh louhel ding ahi. Ajeh chu ama chu ahung pen a patna athi chan geija Nazir khat hina a Pathen'a kitohdoh ding ahi. Aman Philistine tea konna Israel te ahin huhdoh ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 13:5 \xt Minbu 6:1-5\x*   
\p
\v 6 Hichun hiche numeinu chu alhai jellin ajipa aga hetsah tan ahi, “Pathen mikhat kakom’ah ahung kilah in, ama chu Pathen vantil toh akilouvin, vet ding tijat umtah ahi. Hoiya hungkon ham ti kana dongpon aman jong amin eiseipeh pon ahi.  
\v 7 Ahinlah aman 'Nao nahin vop ding chapa khat nahin ding ahi'” ati. Jujong nadon louding khamnathei adang, ipi hijongleh nadon louding nehjong nanehlou ding ahi ati. Ajeh chu nachapa chu ahung penna patna athi nichan geija Nazir khat iding Pathenna kikatdohding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Manoah Pathen hengah ataovin aseitai, “Pakai, lungset tah in Pathen mipa chu avellin hungkit henlang ahung peng ding chapang chung chang chu eiseipeh behen” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Pathen’in Manoah taona chu asangin avellin ajinu loulaija atoupetnin Pathen vantil chu ahung kilah kitnin ahi. Ahinla ajipa Manoah chu amanu kom'a ana umlou pet ahi.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun amanu chu gangtah in ajipa kom'a alhai jallin agaseipeh in, “Nikhatna kakom'a hung kilah a chu avellin ahung kit e” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Manoah chu ajinu chutoh alelhaij'in adongtan ahi, “Nangma hi nikhatna kajinu kom'a hung kilah chu nahim?” tin ana dongin ahi.  
\p Aman ahin donbut in “Kahi” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Hijeh chun Manoah in hiti hin ana dong tai, “Na thusei chu ahung guilhun teng hiche chapang chun ipi atoh ding ham chuleh itobanga hinkho aman ding ham?” tin ana dong tai.   
\p
\v 13 Pakai vantil chun ahin donbutnin, “Najinun atoh ding ka seipeh ho chu phatah a ajui ding ahi,  
\v 14 Amanun lengpithei twija kon poupou chu aneh louding chuleh ju hihenlang khamnathei adang itobang hijongleh adon louding chuleh athenglou pou-pou chu aneh louding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hiche jou chun Manoah in Pakai vantil kom'a chun aseije, “Lungsettah in keinin naneh ding kelnou khat kahin honlhon tokah in hiche ahin um tadin” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Pakai vantil chun adonbutnin “Anaum nange” ahinlah ima kaneh louding ahi, hijeng jongleh Pakai kom'a kilhaina a pumgo thilto nabol thei lhon ding ahi” ati. (Manoah chun Pakai vantil chu Pakai ahilam ahetlou ahi).   
\p
\v 17 Hichun Manoah in Pakai vantil kom'a chun “Namin ipi ham?” tin ana dongin ahi. Ajeh chu hiche ho jouse hi ahung guilhun tengleh keinin namin hi kajabol thei lhonna dingin” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Pakai vantil chun adonbutnin, “Ipi dinga kamin neidoh ham? Nangin nahet dinga kidang val ding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Manoah in kelnou khat toh lousohga themkhat toh ahin choijin song chunga chun Pakai kom'ah pumgo thilto din atohdoh lhon tan ahi. Chutia chu Manoah teni nupan avetpet lhon chun Pakai chun thil kidangtah aboldoh tan ahi.  
\v 20 Hichea maicham a konna meikong chu vanlanga akontou phat chun Pakai vantil jong chu meikong lah a chun akaltou tan ahi. Manoah leh ajinun hichu amu lhon phatnin abohkhup lhon'in jana apelhon tai.   
\p
\v 21 Vantil chu Manoah te nupa kom'ah avellin ahung kilah kit tapon ahi. Hichun Manoah chun Pakai vantil chu Pakai ahi, ti ahedoh tai.  
\v 22 Aman ajinu kom'ah hitin aseije, “Eini ithi tei-tei ding ahitai ajeh chu einin Pathen imulhon tan ahi” akiti lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Ahinlah ajinun, “Pakai chun eitha lhon ding ahilah kelnou leh lhosoh ga chu sang ponte, ama eini kom'a jong hung kilah louding eini kom'a hitobang ho jong abol louding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 24 Achapa chu ahungso phatnin amanun jong amin Samson asahtai, chuleh ama chu ahung khanlet to kilhon'in Pakaijin phatthei aboh in ahi.  
\v 25 Ama Zorah leh Eshtaol khopi teni kikah a Mahaneh-dan mun a achen petnin Pakai Lhagaovin ama chu ahin hatdoh sah tan ahi.   
\c 14  
\s1 Samson Thulem  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat hi Timnah khopia Samson aga chesuh leh, Philistine nungah khat ahin mudoh in ahi.  
\v 2 Inna ahung kile phatnin aman anu le apa kom'ah, “Timnah kho ah Philistine nungah khat kamun kadei lheh jengin ahi, ama khu kaji dingin eiga puipeh lhon'in,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Anu le apan anel lhon'in, “Eiho phunga numei umlou hija ahilouleh Israel te jouse lah a nakichenpi thei umlouhel'a hitam?” Amanin aseilhon'in, “Ipi dinga chep tanlou Philistine holah a ji naga kipui ding ham?” ati lhon'e.  
\p Ahinlah Samson'in apa kom'ah “Neiga puipeh in, amanu khun kalung atoh lheh jenge” ati.  
\v 4 Hiche thilsoh hi Samson chu Philistine te toh akidouna dinga Pathen thilgon ahilam chu anu leh apan ahet lhon lou ahi. Ajeh chu hichea pat a hi Israel te chu Philistine te thaneina noija uma ahiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Hiti chun Samson chu anu leh apa toh Timnah kho a achesuh un ahileh Timnah kho a lengpithei lei kom aphah uchun keipi bahkai gol khatnin poh phungin ahin ngih in ahi.  
\v 6 Hiche pettah chun Pakai Lhagao chun Samson chu poh phungin ahin hatdoh sah in ahileh, Samson in akhutkeo seh in akha ahin kaopeh in, min kelnou abolna bangin abol jengin ahi. Ahinlah aman thilsoh chu anu leh apa ana seipeh pon ahi.  
\v 7 Samson chu Timnah khopi alhun phat in hiche nungahnu chutoh akihoulim lhon'in ahileh amanun Samson chu alunglhai sah lheh jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Khonungin amanu chu kichenpi dingin Timnah kho achun aga kilekitnin ahileh lampam’a chun keipi bahkai thilong chu agahven ahileh hiche thilong sunga chun khoiju bom ana kaijin ahi.  
\v 9 Aman khoiju chu akhut in themkhat agah kheodoh in achepum pumin anen ahi. Aman anu le apa jong themkhat apen ahile amanin jong anelhon’in ahi. Ahinla aman keipi bahkai thilong sunga khoiju alahdoh chu aseipeh lhon pon ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Apan kichenna dinga tohgon achai ding konna akisahlel laitah chun, Samson in Timnah kho a golvah khat abollin ahi, hichu hiche phat laija khangthah ho chonna ngai chu achepi ahi.  
\v 11 Mounu nu le pa chun Samson chu amu phatnin aloi agol dingin khopi sunga kon chun gollhang somthum agonpeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Samson’in amaho kom'a chun, “Nangho kom'ah thulem khat seijing ting nang hon hiche golvah nisagi sunga hi na seidoh thei uva ahileh keiman nangho tupat ponnem somthum leh golvah von somthum kapeh diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 13 “Ahinlah nang hon na seidoh theilou uleh nang hon tupat ponnem somthum leh golvah von somthum keima neipeh diu ahi,” ati.  
\p Ama hon “Aphai kanom uve hiche thulem chu ipiham nei seipeh tauvin” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun aman aseitan ahi:  
\b  
\q1 “Mi nepa a kon'in nehthei themkhat ahungdoh e,  
\q2 mihatpa a kon'in alhumkei themkhat ahung doh e,” ati.  
\b  
\p Nithum sungin ama hon hetdohtei ding ago uvin ahin ahedoh jou pouvin ahi.  
\v 15 Anili chanin Samson jinu kom'a chun, “Hiche thulem hi najipa a kon'in hetdoh tei hin gon achuti louleh napa in hi nang puma kahal lhah tha diu ahi. Nanghon hiche golvah a hi suhjum dinga neikou uham?” atiuve.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun Samson kom'a chun ajinu in mitlhi pumin aseijin, “Nang hin nei lungset ahipoi, nei vetda joh ahi bouve! Nangin kamite thulem khat nasei khumin ahinlah kei kom'ah aledohna ding nei seipeh poi” ati.  
\p Aman adonbutnin, “Hiche ledohna hi kanu le kapa kom jenga jong ka seipeh lou ahi, nang kom'a iti ka seidoh ding ham?” ati.  
\v 17 Hiti chun golvah sunga chun amanun nei seipeh teijin tin akom'a akap jengin ahi. Ajonan nisagi channa in aman aledohna chu aseipeh tan ahi, ajeh chu amanun phat tinna asuhboi jing jeng ahi. Hichun amanun gollhangho kom'a chun aseipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hijou chun nisagi channi nilhum masangin khopi miho chu ahungun  
\b  
\q1 “Khoiju sanga lhumjo ipi um ding ham?  
\q2 Keipi bahkai sanga hatjo ipi um ding ham?” atiuve.  
\b  
\p Samson in adonbutnin,” Kabongla na manchah louvu hileh ka thulem chu hoiya nahet diu ham!” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hiche jou chun Samson chunga Pakai Lhagao chu thaneitah in achung’ah ahung chutan, ama Ashkelon khopia chun achesuh in, mi somthum aga thatnin anei hou ahin chomin athulem seidoh miho chu akitepna ponho chu aga petan ahi. Ahinla Samson chu hiche chung changa chun alung phamo lheh jengin a inlanga akile in anu le apa toh aum khom'un ahi.  
\v 20 Hijeh chun ajinu chu Samson golphapen pa kom'ah ana peuvin ana kichen sah tauvin ahi.   
\c 15  
\s1 Samson In Philistine Te Aphulah  
\p
\v 1 Khonungin, suhlou chang lhun phat in Samson’in kelchanou khat ajinu peh dingin ahin choijin ahungin ahi. Hichun aman aseijin, “Keima kajinu indan sunga che–ing ting galuppi ing kate,” atin ahinlah ajinu hingpa apan ana lutsah tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Numeinu pan ana seijin, “Keiman kagel'a chu nangman na jinu chu nadeilou mong-mong ahitai katia, nagol phapenpa kom'a aji ding'a kanapeh ahitai, ahinla ven anaonu hi amanu sanga hoijo louham, amahi kichenpi tan” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Samson in hitin aseije, “Tunvang Philistine te chunga itobang bol jongleng themmo taponge” ati.  
\v 4 Hijou chun apotdoh in Sial jathum aga man’in amei u akhit mat-mat un hiche akopto khat cheh chu meisel toh ahel kopmin ahi.  
\v 5 Hijou chun, meiyin ahallin Sial ho chu Philistine te loulai changphung lah a chun alhalut in ahi. Hiti chun chang ho chu aga le akung pummin ahallha jengin lengpithei leh Olive thing kisan’in ahallhah tha jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Philistine ho chun, “Hiche hi koibol bepseo hitam?” atiuvin ahileh  
\p “Samson” ahi, Timnah mi apupa chun Samson jinu chu agol phapenpa toh kicheng dinga ana pehdoh jeh a abol ahi” atiuve. Hijeh chun Philistine te chu acheuvin numeinu nu le pa chu amandoh uvin meijah ahallih tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Samson akihahsel'in “Nang hon hiche hi nabol jeh un nachung uva phu kalah tokah a kaki choldo louding ahi,” ati.  
\v 8 Hijeh chun aman lunghang tah in Philistine ho chu anokhumin mi tamtah athatnin ahi. Hiche jou chun ama achen Etam mun a songpi khat achun agacheng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Philistine ten alethuh un Judah gamsung'ah ngahmun asemun Lehi khopi kom geijin akithe jao jengun ahi.  
\v 10 Judah mipite chun Philistine ho chu adongun “Ipi bolla neihung delkhum uham?” atiuve.  
\p Philistine ten adonbut un, “Keiho Samson man dinga hung kahiuve, aman keiho chunga thilse abol hi lethuh dinga kahung’u ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun Judah mite 3,000 chu Etam songpi ko hom'a um Samson chu gamandoh dingin achesuh un ahi. Ama hon Samson kom'a chun “Philistine te hin ichung uva vai ahom u ahi tihi nahet louham-kachung uva hi ipi bepseo nabol hitam?” atiuve.  
\p Ahin Samson in adonbutnin “Ama hon kei chunga abol tobang bepma kalethuh ahi bouve” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Judah mipi ho chun ama kom'a aseijun,” Keihon nangma hi kantum'a Philistine ho khut a pedoh dinga kahungu ahi,” atiuve.  
\p Samson in aseijin, “Aphai ahinla nangho tah in neitha louna diuvin kitem un” atin   
\p
\v 13 ama hon adonbut un “Keihon ka kantum uva Philistine khut a ka pehdoh diu ka thalou diu ahi.” Hijeh chun khao thah ni in akan'un songpi a konin ahin puidoh uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Samson chu Lehi ahunglhun phatnin Philistine ho chun noise tah in kholhang asam'un ahin delkhumun ahi. Ahinla Pakai lhagao chu thaneitah in Samson chunga ahung chun, akikanna khaoho chu meiyin patjang akahtan bangin atumtan gamtan ahi.  
\v 15 Hijou chun aman sangan khagu thah khat amun, hichu alan Philistine mi sangkhat hichea chun athat tan ahi.  
\v 16 Samson’in aseije,  
\b  
\q1 “Sangan khagu mangchan  
\q2 alom chang’in kajam'e!,  
\q1 sangan khagu mangchan  
\q2 mi sangkhat kathatnin ahi!” ati.   
\b  
\m
\v 17 Aman ahanla sap chu achai phat in sangan khagu chu apaimang tan ahi. Hiche mun chu Khagu Mol akisah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hijou chun ama adangchah lheh jengtan ahileh Pakai kom'ah akapjah jengin, “Nangin na lhachapa thahatna mangchan galjona loupitah neipe tan ahi. Tua hi dangchah a kathia hiche cheptan louho khutna hi kalou ding hitam?” ati.  
\v 19 Hijeh chun Pathen'in Mol a tolgolai chu apokeh sah in twi ahung kikhodoh jengtan ahi. Samson’in hichu adonin akido doh tan ahi. Hijeh chun hiche mun chu “Akapjahpa Twikhuh” asah un hichu tuni geijin Mol achun aum nalaiye.   
\p
\v 20 Philistine ten gamsunga vai ana homlaijun Samson chu Israel te chungah kum somni thutan’in ana pangin ahi.   
\c 16  
\s1 Samson In Gaza Khopi Kelkot Apohmang  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat hi Samson Philistine khopi Gaza a chun achen numei chavai khattoh jan in aga lumkhom'in ahi.  
\v 2 Samson hikom'a aum chu akithangdoh loijin Gaza a um miho chu akikhomun khopi kelkot phunga chun angah khovah tauvin ahi. Amaho thipbeh chan aum’un, “Jingkah kho ahung vah-vah leh itha diu ahi” akitiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahinlah Samson chu jankhang geijin bou jalkhun a chun alumin ahi. Hijou chun athoudoh in khopi kelkot chu akhom tenia apun Hebron lam ngat thinglhang vum'a apudoh in ahi.   
\s1 Samson Le Delilah  
\p
\v 4 Chomkhat jouvin Samson hi Sorek phaicham'a cheng Delilah kiti numei khat toh ahung kilungset in ahi.  
\v 5 Philistine vaipo ho chu amanu kom'a acheuvin hitin aga seijun ahi, “Samson hi jolin lang ipipen in ahatsah ham chuleh i-nakilo leh chatmo hel'a nakikan tum jou ding ham? Hitia chu nahin bol thei leh keiho mikhat cheh in dangka 1,100 kapeh diu ahi atiuve.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun Delilah in Samson kom'ah hitin aseije, “Ipi penin nang hi hibanga nahat sah ham chuleh i-nakilo leh chatmo hel'a nakikan tum jou ding ham lungsettah in nei seipeh in” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Samson’in adonbutnin, “Keima hi gophel khao athahleh jang sagi in eikikan chah kheh henlang hileh katha lhasam’in tin midang bep-bep kahi ding ahitai” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Philistine lamkai hon gophel khao athah cheh jang sagi ahin choipeh un, Hichea chun Delilah in Samson chu akanchah kheh in ahi.  
\v 9 Amanun a insung pindan sunga chu mi phabep asel ahin, hichun amanu apeng jah in, “Samson, Philistine te naman dingin ahung tauve!” atin ahi. Ahinla Samson chun gophel khaoho chu meiyin ahallhah bangin abot tan gamtan ahil. Hiti chun athahatna chu akimandoh jou tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiche jou chun Delilah in akom’ah aseijin, “Nangin nei dai chavaijin jouvin neibol'e! Tun lungsettah in nei seipeh in” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Samson’in adonbutnin, “Kei hi khatveicha ana kimang cha khalou khaovin eikikan leh katha lhasam'in tin midang toh kabah ding ahitai,” atipeh e.   
\p
\v 12 Hijeh chun Delilah in khatveicha ana kimang khalouhel khao thahbeh cheh in akantum’in ahi. Mi phabep khat chu amasa a banga chu indan sung khat a kisel uva ahi, avellin Delilah apeng jah kit in, “Samson, Philistine te naman dingin ahung tauve!” atin ahileh akikan na khao ho jouse chu patjang bangin atan gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun Delilah in aseijin, “Nangin nei dai chavaijin, jou jengin nei bol'e! Tunvang itileh chatmoa nakikan tum thei ding ham nei hetsah tan” ati.  
\p Samson’in adonbutnin, “Nangman kaluchanga kasam ba-sagi hi pheh lechun katha hung lhasam in tin, midang bep-bep kahi ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun a imut sungin Delilah in aluchanga asam basagi chu alom lommin aveijin chule abonchan thih khatnin akildet sohkeijin ajah a, “Vo Samson, Philistine mite naman dingin ahung tauve” ati. Samson ahung khah phatnin thihjang jong asam lom jong aban bodoh soh kittan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hiche jou chun Delilah chun lung nommo tah in ahin seijin, “Nangin na thuguh bon nei seipeh nom louva iti danna kalungset e nati ham? Nangin thumvei jen nei dai chavaijin ipin nahatsah ham ti nei seipeh pon ahi!” ati.  
\v 16 Amanun niseh a hitia hi anano jinga asuhboi jing phat hin alungthim asuna lheh jengin athinom leu tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Akhonna in athuguh ho chu ahin seidoh tai, kasam hi khatveicha kivou khaloulai ahi tin ahin phongdoh tai, “Kei hi kapen apatna Nazir hinkho mang dinga Pathen'a eina kitohdohsa kahitai. Kasam hi kivou henlang hileh ka thahat nan eidalhah ding ahitai, hiteng chuleh midang bep-bep kahi ding ahitai” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Delilah in tuavang hi atahbeh eiseipeh ahitai ti ahet phatnin Philistine lamkai ho chu akou kittai, “Khatvei hungkit pou pouvun, tuvang hin atahbeh chu eiseipeh tai” ati. Hijeh chun Philistine lamkaiho chun sum ahin choijun akom'a ahungkit tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Delilah chun Samson chu asam ba-sagi a kipheh chu avolhah sah in, hiti chun Samson chu imacha hilou asosah tan, athahat nan adalha tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun ama apeng jah in, “Samson, Philistine te naman dingin ahung tauve,” ati. Ama ahungkhah phatnin akingaiton, “Keima amasa bang bangin kei le kei kihuhdoh jou nange,” tin agelin ahi. Ahinla aman Pakaijin adalhah lam chu ana hetlou ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hiti chun Philistine ten aman’un amit teni akheodoh peh un Gaza lama apuijun hichea chun sum-eng thihkhaovin akannun songkulla ahen’un sumhei goijin apansah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Ahinlah chomkah louvin asam ahung kehdoh pan kittan ahi.   
\s1 Samson Galjona  
\p
\v 23 Philistine lamkai ten golvah loupitah khat aneiyun hichea chu pumgo thilto abolji uva asemthu pathen'u Dagon chu athangvah jiu ahi. Ama hon hitin aseijun, “Eiho pathen’in igalmi u Samson hi eiho khut ah eipe tauve” atiuve.   
\p
\v 24 Mipi ten amu phat un amaho semthu pathen chu athangvah un hitin asei uve, “Eiho pathen’in igalmi pau eiho khut ah ahin pedoh tan ahi, igamsungu sumanga mi tamtah eithat pau chu tun eiho thaneina noijah aumtai” atiuve.   
\p
\v 25 Amaho akham thim laitah un, “Samson chu hin puidoh un golnop bolnan neiju hite!” atiuve. Hichun Samson chu mipi nopsahna dingin songkul'a kon'in ahin puidoh tauvin, hiche inpi thah apanga khompi lencheh ni kikah a chun adinsah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Hichun Samson’in ama kailea pang chapangpa kom'a chun, “Hichea inpi theh a pang khomlen cheh ni kikah a chun nei dinsah in keiman kingainan nei jinge,” atin ahi.  
\v 27 Hiche inpi chu mi dimset jenga ahi. Philistine te milen milal jouse jong um uva ahin, chuleh hiche inchung dan a chun numei pasal aboncha uvin mi 3,000 jenin Samson chu golnop a avet u ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Hichun Samson chu Pakai kom'ah ataovin, “Vo thanei tah Pakai keima hi neihin geldoh kitnin O Pathen, lungsettah in khatvei seh-seh neihin hatdoh sah kit in. Hiche khatvei thaneina chun Philistine ten kamit teni asuh chot u phu hi nei lahsah teijin” ati.  
\v 29 Hichun Samson’in hiche inpi theh a pang khompi teni a chun akhut teni chu akoiyin,  
\v 30 hichun Samson ataovin, “Hiche Philistine te hitoh thi tha tange” ati. Hichun athanei chasun’in asonin ahileh inpi chu ahung chimin Philistine milen milal ho leh asunga um mipi ho jouse chu aseplih tan ahi. Hiti chun hiche athi nikhoa atha ho chu adamlaija atha ho sangin atamjon ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Hiche jou chun asopiho leh a insung miho along la dingin achesuh un, ama hon along chu agala uvin apa Manoah kivuina Zorah leh Esthtaol kikah ah chun avui tauve.   
\c 17  
\s1 Micah Milim Doi Semthu  
\p
\v 1 Phat khatnin Micah kiti pasal khat ana umin ama chu Ephraim thinglhang gamsunga chenga ahi.  
\v 2 Nikhat hi aman anu kom'ah hitin anaseije, “Mikhat in nasum dangka 1,100 anaguh jeh in nangin na-na samse tai ti kana jan ahi. Ven nasum gu achu keima kahi chuleh tun kakom'a aum'e” ati.  
\p Anun adonbutnin, “Nang le nang na kiphon ahin Pathen'in phatthei naboh hen” ati.  
\v 3 Aman sum chu anu kom'a apelutnin ahileh anun hitin aseije “Tun keiman hiche sapsetna chu kachapa chunga achuh louna dingin keima tah in hiche sum chu Pakai kom'ah ka tohdoh tai. Hiche hi kilhajol'a milim doi khat semna a kimang ding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Hitia chu aman sum chu anu khutna apehlut chun amanun dangka 200 chu alan dangka khengpa kom'ah apelut tan ahileh aman milim doikhat asemdoh tan ahi. Chuleh hiche chu Micah insung'ah akikoi tan ahi.  
\v 5 Micah hin hiche doi koina dinga hin doiphung khat atung doh in chuleh hiche doi houna ding ompho jong asem’in insunga ding phabep jong asemdoh in ahi. Hiche jou chun achate lah a khat chu ama changa din thempun apansah in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hichelai phat sung chun Israel ten leng ana nei pouvin mipi ho chu amaho deidan danin ana kimang chauvin ahi. \x + \xo 17:6 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 21:25\x*   
\p
\v 7 Nikhat chun Judah gam Bethlehem a cheng gollhang khat ahung vahlutnin ahi.  
\v 8 Aman Bethlehem chu ahin dalhah a chenna ding holla ahung vale-le leh Ephraim thinglhang gam'a hi hung vahlut kha ahi. Hitia hi ahung vale-le nalam ahin Micah in na hin ahung vahlut khan ahi.  
\v 9 Micah in “Hoiya konna hung nahim?” tin ana dongin ahi.  
\p Aman adonbutnin, “Kei hi Levi mi Judah gam Bethlehem'a konna hung kahin keima hi chenna ding mun holla hung kahi” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Micah in, “Keikom'a hin um tan chutileh nang keima dinga mipa leh thempu nahi ding ahi” ati.  
\v 11 Levi mipa chu ana nom in, hiti chun hiche gollhangpa chu Micah chate khat tobangin aum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hiti chun Micah in hiche Levi pa chu ama thempu in ana pansah in, ama jong Micah in'ah ana cheng tan ahi.  
\v 13 Micah in “Tunvang Pakaijin phatthei eiboh ding ahitai, ajeh chu keiman Levi khat thempu a eipan peh ding kanei tai” ati.   
\c 18  
\s1 Dan Phung'a Limsemthu  
\p
\v 1 Hiche phatlai hin Israel ten leng aneipon ahi. Chuleh Dan phung hin achen theina diu mun ana hol'un ahi. Ajeh chu Israel phungho chenna ding mun ana kihop laiyuva amaho chu ana kipehna mun a chu chenglut loulai ahiuve.  
\v 2 Hijeh chun Dan mite chun amaho phung lah a kon'in amaho chenlut theina ding mun vetohle dingin Zorah leh Eshtaol khopi hoa kon'in gal-hang mihat cheh nga ana lhengdoh un ahi.  
\p Hiche gal-hat ho hi Ephraim thinglhang gam ahung lhun uhin Micah in'ah ahung lhung’un ajan geh tauvin ahi.  
\v 3 Micah in'a aum sung’u chun ama hon Levi mipa chu apaotho dan a kon chun ahedoh jengun hijeh chun acheuvin ama chu agadong tauvin, “Kon hilai mun’a hi na-na puilut a hichea hi ipi nabol ham? Chuleh ipi dinga hichea hi naum ham?” tin ana dong un ahi.  
\v 4 Aman Micah toh akinoptona chuleh Micah in athempua apansahna thu chu aseipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun ama hon aseijun, “Ka kholjin nau hi lolhinna kanei diu hinam? Ahiloule lolhinna ka neilou diu ham? Pathen kom’ah neidoh peh un,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 6 Thempupa chun adonbut in ajah uvah, “Lungmongin chetauvin, Pathen’in na kholjinna uva hin naching jing nauve,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hiti chun mi nga ho chu Laish khopi langa acheuvin ahileh hichea mite chun hinkho nomtah amangun Sidon mite bangin lungmong tah le lung gimlou hel'in achengui ti amudoh tauvin ahi. Hiche mipi ho chu agam’u aphat jeh in ahao thei lheh jeng’un ahi. Chuleh amaho chu Sidon’a konna gamla tah in achengun avel uvah pankhompi thei jong anei pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Amaho chu Zorah leh Eshtaol a akile phat uchun asopi houvin ana dongun, “Na thilmu hou itobang nam?” atin ana dong uve.   
\p
\v 9 Ama hon adonbutnun ajah uvah, “Hungun amaho khu gakisatpiu hite keihon agam chu kagamu uvin, agam u chu apha lheh jenge. Ipi na nga nahlai diu ham? Gache a amun galo ding khu lungsa-ihna neihih hel’un,” ati tauve.  
\v 10 Nangho nache uva amun naga lhun tengu leh amipi te khu imacha lungkhamna anei pouve ti namudoh diu ahi. Pathen’in gam lentah le gam phatah imacha avat umlouhel mun khu eipeh u ahi!” atiuve.   
\p
\v 11 Hijeh chun Dan phunga kon'in galsatna manchah kichoi cheh mi jagup Zorah leh Eshtaol’a kon'in ahung kipat doh un,  
\v 12 Judah gam Kiriath-jearim lhumlam munkhat ah panmun akisem’un ahi. Hiche mun hi Mahaneh-dan ti in tuni chan gei jin amin akisah tan ahi.  
\v 13 Hichea kon chun Ephraim thinglhang gam'a Micah in chu agalhung tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Mi nga Laish vella gam gavetoh a cheho chun aloidang ho chu aseipeh un, “Hiche in hoa hin thempu ompho leh insung mite doi ho leh milim semthu chuleh thing’a kisema dangka a kitom doi jong uma ahi, hiche ho hi ilo ding natiuvem?” atiuve.  
\v 15 Hijeh chun mi nga ho chu lampia kon’in akiheidoh un Micah insunga chun alut un Levi gollhang pan khohsahna neitah in ana lamton ahi.  
\v 16 Dan phunga konna gal manchah kichoi mi jagup ho chu kelkot kom'a chun ading jingun ahi.  
\v 17 Gam vetoh a ana che mi nga ho chu doihouna munna chun alut un milim semthu, thempu ompho le insung doiho leh dangka a kitom doi chu akilah tauve. Hiche sung chun thempupa chu kelkot kom'a chun gal manchah choi mi jagup chutoh ading khom’un ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Thempupa chun Micah doi koina maicham in a konna thil thengho ahinlah doh uchu amu phatnin, “Ipi nabol u hitam?” ahin tin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Ama hon “Thipbeh in keiho dingin mipa leh thempun hung pang tan, mikhat seh insunga thempu nahi sangin Israel phung khat thempu nahi ding chu phajo louham?” atiuve.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun gollhang thempupa chu amaho toh kilhon ding chu atha anom lheh jengin ahi. Hiti chun aman thempu ompho ahin, insung doiho le milim doi kisem ho chu achoijin alah uvah apang tan ahi.  
\v 21 Amaho ahung kileheijun akholjin’u ajomkit tauvin ahi, hiti chun achapang teu, agancha hou leh athilkeu hou amasat sah un ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Dan phung miho chu Micah inmun'a kon’a gamla tah agei phat’un Micah in aheng akomho chu ahin puijin ahin del tauvin ahi.  
\v 23 Ama hon ahin phah phat un, hiti hin ahin hoh un ahileh, Dan mite chu ahung kileheijun Micah kom’ah chun hiti hin ahin seijun ahi, “Ipi thu hitam? Ipi dinga amaho pihi nahin puija neihin del uham”? atiuve.   
\p
\v 24 Micah in adonbutnin, “Ipi nabol nau ham? Ipi thu hitam? Ken kakisem ka pathen jouse nang hon nei lahpeh un, kathempu pa kisan nei puidoh peh tauvin! Tua hi nei chom thenghel'u hitalou ham?” ahin ti.   
\p
\v 25 Dan miho chun hiti hin ahin donbut’un, “Kichih theijin mohpao pao hih in ajoleh hiche mite hi hung lunghang’un tin nang le na insung mite chu nathalo diu ahi” atiuve.  
\v 26 Hiti chun Dan mite chu akijot kit tauve. Micah chun amaho chu kisatpi ding angapchat louj eh in ahung kileheijin a inlam'a achetai.   
\p
\v 27 Hiche jou chun Dan mite chun Micah doi ho leh athempupa chutoh Laish khopi chu aga lhung tauve. Ama hon achemjam’un asatchap jengun akhopi chu meijin ahallha tauve.  
\v 28 Koimacha amaho huhdoh ding chu anaum tapon ahi, ajeh chu amaho Sidon’a konna gamla tah a chenga ahiuvin koima kitho khompi ding anei pouvin ahi. Hiche thilsoh hi Beth-rehob phaicham kom ahi.  
\p Dan phung mite chun khopi chu akisemphat un hilai mun a chun acheng tauve.  
\v 29 Ama hon hiche khopi chu apu apau Israel chapa min alosah un Dan asah tauve, ahin atil abulla chu Laish ana kitia ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Hijou chun adoilim chu atungdoh un Mose cha Gershom chapa Jonathan chu thempun apansah tauve. Hiche Dan insung mite hi soh channa a alut tokah seuhin, amaho hi hiche mite thempun ana pan peh un ahi.  
\v 31 Hiti chun Pathen ponbuh chu Shiloh a aum laise chun Micah doi sem chu Dan miten ana hou jingun ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Levi Mikhat Le Athaikemu  
\p
\v 1 Hiche phatlai hi Israel ten leng ananei masangu chu ahi. Ephraim thinglhang gamkun’ah Levi mikhat ana chengin ahi. Nikhat hi aman Judah gam Bethlehem a kon'in numei khat athaikem dingin ahin kipuijin ahi.  
\v 2 Ahinlah amanu hitoh akina-in ahileh Bethlehem'a apa in'ah ana kile kittan ahi.  
\p Lha li alhin jouvin,  
\v 3 ajipa chu Bethlehem jon dingin akipat doh in amanu chu gajol lungdam’a hin kile puikit agot ahi. Aman sangan kopkhat toh alhachapa chu ana kipuijin ahi. Ama ajinu pa in agalhun chun ajinu pa chun ngailutna neitah in ana sangin ahi.  
\v 4 Anupa pa chun nichomkhat beh um dingin ana ngeh in ahi. Hijeh chun, ama chu nithum anichongin, aneuvin, adonun chuleh ajan geh un ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Nili channi chun amapa chu matah in athouvin cheding akigo tan, ahinla anupa pa chun amapa kom'a chun “Nache kah un bu themkhat beh gahne kitnun,” atin ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun amani jong atoukit lhon'in themkhat anelhon tan ahi. Hijou chun numeinu pa chun hiti hin ahin seikit in, “Lungset tah in jankhat beh gehkit inlang kicholdo kit un ati.”  
\v 7 Levi pa chu akipatdoh in achego tan ahileh anupa pan aum kitna diuvin angeh teitei jengin ahileh ajona in anom’in jankhat ageh kittai.   
\p
\v 8 Ni nga channin ama chu matah in athouvin che dingin akigo tai, ahin numeinu pa chun, “Nehthei themkhat beh nenlang nilhah lamleh chenauvin nate” tin ahin seikit in ahi. Hichun amaho chun nehkhomna aneikit un ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche jou chun amapa le athaikemnu chuleh alhachapa chu che dingin akigo tauvin ahi, anupa pan aseijin, “Ven tuhi nilhah lang hi ding ahitai, tujan gehkit inlang nomtah in kicholdon lang jing tengleh matah in thouvin natin na inlam'u jon tauvin nate,” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Ahinlah hiche chung vang hin chetei agotan ahi. Hijeh chun asangan teni leh athaikemnu chu akipuijin Jebus (Hichu Jerusalem) lang ahin jon tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 Jebus anai phat in agei thim lheh tan alhachapa chun akom’a chun “Jebus khopia hin kinga pa uhitin, jan geh tau hite” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Apakaipan “Hithei ponte Israel mi umnalou gam chom mite khopia ige theilou diu ahi, hiche sang chun Gibeah lam ana jonsuh taohite.  
\v 13 Hungin Gibeah ahilouleh Ramah lhuntei go uhitin hiche khopiho khat pen-pen ahin gehnau hite” ati.  
\v 14 Hiti chun ache tauve. Gibeah agalhun uchun nisa lhum ding kon ahitai, Gibeah chu Benjamin gamsunga khopi khat ahi.  
\v 15 Hilai mun achun akinga uvin jan-geh dingin akigo tauvin ahi. Koiman a inna lhunsah dinga akoulou jeh uchun hiche khopi lamlen khatna chun akicholnga tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hiche jan chun tehse alouva anatohna a kon a-inlam hinjon khat aumin ahi. Ama chu Ephraim thinglhang a konna Gibeah a hung kichaolut ahin, hiche khopia chengho hi Benjamin phungmi ahiuve.  
\v 17 Amaho chu khopi lamsom’a anatou chu amu phatnin “Hoiya hungkon hoilang jon ding nahiuvam?” tin ana dongin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Amapan adonbutnin, “Keiho hi Judah gam Bethlehem’a konna Ephraim thinglhang gamgil'a um ka inmun u jon ding kahiuve. Ahinla koiman a-in na lhung dingin eikou pouvin ahi.  
\v 19 Keihon ka ngaichat diu jouse kanei nauve, sangan neh ding changpol kaneijun, keiho neh ding changlhah le theitwi lhingset in kanei naovin ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 20 Tehsepu chun, “Kei kom'ah geh tauvin, keiman na ngaichat diu jouse nape nauvinge, amavang hiche lamsom’a vang hin jan-geh hihbeh un,” ati.  
\v 21 Hiti chun a-in na apuijin asangan teni jong chu avahtan ahi. Ama hon akeng akisil uvin an anekhom'un chule adon khom'un ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Nomsatah a agah umpet laitah un, khopi sunga kon chun miphalou honkhat in in chu ahin umkhum'un, kot chu ahin chum’un tehsepu chu ahinsap thouvin, “Na in'a lhungpa chu hin puidoh in keihon numei bol'a kabol diu ahi” atiuvin ahi. \x + \xo 19:22 \xt Semtilbu 19:5-8\x*   
\p
\v 23 Tehsepu chu amaho to kihou dingin apotdoh in aga kihoupin “Ahipoi sopi teho, hitobang thilse chu bolpou hite, ajeh chu amapa hi ka-in na lhung kamaljin ahi bouve, chutobang thil melse tah chu bol poute.  
\v 24 Veuvin, kachanu nungah thengtah khat leh hiche mipa thaikemnu hi hin pedoh inge nalo lo lotauvin, ahinla hiche mipa chunga vang hin chutobang thil melse chu bol hihbeh un” ati.   
\p
\v 25 Ahinlah ama hon angaideh pouvin ahi. Hijeh chun Levi pa chun athaikemnu chu kotpam'a asondoh in ahileh, khopi mite chun amanu chu khovah lhah tokah in kichepnan anei tauvin ahi. Khovah then-then chun amanu chu alhakang bep un ahi.  
\v 26 Khovah lhah chun amanu chu ajipa lhunna a chun ahung kilen kotbul aphah chun alhulhop tan khovah lhah geijin ana kijam tan ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Ajipan gahpot dinga kotchu ahin hon leh athaikemnu chu kotbulla ana kijam jengin akhut teni chu tolla ana kiphatho jengin ahi.  
\v 28 Aman “Thouvin! chetau hite!” atileh adonbut tapon ahi. Hiti chun atahsa chu sangan chungah ajamin ain geijin apoluttai.   
\p
\v 29 Ain alhun phatnin, chem khat alan athaikemnu chu boh som le bohni ason bohkhat cheh chu Israel gam pumpia phungkhat cheh chu athot in ahi. \x + \xo 19:29 \xt 1 Samuel 11:7\x*   
\p
\v 30 Hiche mujouse chun, “Israel ten Egypt ahin dalhah uva pat tuni chan geijin hitobang thil melse hi sohkha hih laijin ahi chule mujong akimu kha hih laiye, hichepi hi gel temun, tua hi ipi ibol uva i-ilo diu hitam? Koiham aseithei ding’ah?” akiti tauvin ahi.   
\c 20  
\s1 Israel ten Benjamin Mite Douna Gal Abol  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jouhin Israel chate jouse Dan apat Beersheba, chuleh Gilead gam chan geijin ahung kikhom uvin, mikhat seh-seh tobangin lungkhat tah in ading khom’un ahi. Mipite chu Pakai angsung'ah Mizpah munnah akikhom sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 2 Israel phungho jouse leh mipi ho jouse lah a lamkaiho chu Pathen mite kikhopna achun apangun chule chemjam lamthei sepaiho chu 400,000 alhingun ahi.  
\v 3 Alangkhat ah Benjamin mite chun Israel phung dang ho jouse chu Mizpah a akikhom tauve tichu ajatauvin ahi. Hichun Israel mipi chun hitobang thil melse tah hi iti hung kipat ham tin adong tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ajinu athapeh pau Levi pa chun ahin seitai, “Ka thaikemnu le keima hi jan-geh dinga Benjamin mite khopi Gibeah a kache lhon'in ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche jan chun Gibeah mite chun kagena inchu aumkim vellun keima tha ding eigouvin ajonan ka thaikemnu hi jan khovah in kichepnan aneiyun amanu athilo tai.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun keiman ka thaikemnu tahsa hi boh somle bohni kaso’a Israel phung som le phungni hi kahin thot ahi. Ajeh chu hiche mite hin melsetah a hitobang gitlouna hi atohdoh u ahi.  
\v 7 Tun nangho nabon chauvin Israel mipite jousen iloding natiuvem gel tauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun mipite chu aboncha uvin thakhat tah in adingdoh sohkeiyun asam tauve, “Eiho koimacha in na ikile theilou diu ahi!  
\v 9 Amavang eihon tua hi Gibeah mite hitia hi igabol diu ahi, koipenin ikisatpi masat diuham vang isan diu ahi.  
\v 10 Iphung jouse uva hi som lah a khat cheh galsat ho neh le chah thah le a pang ding, adangsen Gibeah chunga hi phu ilah tei diu ahi, ajeh chu Benjamin mite hin Israel insunga hibang tah a hi jumna atohdoh u ahitai” atiuve.  
\v 11 Hiti chun Israel pumpi chu abonchauvin akilungkhat un hiche khopi sat dingin akikhom soh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Israel ten Benjamin mite kom'a chun thupole ho asol’un amaho chun, “Itobang lom'a nangho hin hitobang thilse hi na boldoh uhitam?  
\v 13 Gibeah khoa konna hitobang mi engse miphalou ho chu neihin pedoh un keihon amaho chu that uving ting Israel lah a thilse hi suhthengna nei uvinge” atiuve.  
\p Ahinlah Benjamin ten anahsah pouvin ahi.  
\v 14 Hiche enghotna chun amaho akhopi cheh uva kon'in Gibeah munnah Israel sat dingin ahung kikhom tauvin ahi.  
\v 15 Abonchauvin chemjam lamthei cheh s26,000 alhingun amaho chu Gibeah ahunglhung tauvin ahi. Amaho hi khopi sunga ana umsa thepna giltah nei mi 700 aum’un ahi.  
\v 16 Benjamin lah a thepna giltah nei sepai 700 ho hi aveilanga chatloh cheh ahiuvin, amaho hin songsena bom'a song apeijuleh samjang jeng jong sepkhel louhel cheh ahiuve.  
\v 17 Israel langa Benjamin galmiho simlouvin chemjam kichoija galsat theicheh 400,000 alhingun ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Gal kisat masangin Israel te chu Bethel’ah acheuvin Pathen aga dongun, “Benjamin mipite khu gasat dinga koiphung pen kache masat diu ham?” atiuve.  
\p Pakaijin ahin donbutnin “Judah masa ding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hijeh chun Israel te chu matah in athouvun Gibeah kom'ah panmun asem tauve.  
\v 20 Hijou chun Benjamin mite chu sat dingin Gibeah ana jon tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Ahinlah akhopiu ngah a pang Benjamin galmi ho chu ahung potdoh un hiche nichun gal kisatna mun a chun Israel te 22,000 athat tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Ahinlah Israel te chu khat le khat akitil touvin animasa a akisatnau mun ma-ma achun pan alakit tauvin ahi.  
\v 23 Ajeh chu amaho ana cheuva Bethel’a Pakai angsunga nilhah geija gakap uva hitia hi Pakai agadoh u ahi, “Keiho kache kit uva Benjamin tehi kagasat kit diu ham?” aga tiuve.  
\p Pakaijin “Cheuvin lang amaho khu gaki satpi kitnun” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Hijeh chun amaho ajing chun apotdoh kitnun Benjamin mite chu aga kisatpi kit un ahi.  
\v 25 Ahin Benjamin mite chun chemjam choija galsatje them cheh Israel te chu 18,000 ana that kit’un ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Hiche jeh chun Israel te abonchauvin acheuvin Bethel’ah anngol pumin nilhah geijin Pakai angah agakap un ahi. Ama hon Pakai angah pumgo thilto leh chamna thilto jong abol'un ahi.  
\v 27 Israel te chu Pakai kom'ah acheuvin “I-kati diu hitam?” tin aga dongun ahi. ( Hichelaiya chu Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu Bethel munna uma ahi  
\v 28 Chuleh Aaron thempupa tupa Eleazer chapa Phinehas chu thempu hija ahi.) Israel ten Pakai adongun keihon kasopi teu Benjamin mite hi kasat kit dingu ham ahilouleh kasatda diu hitam?” atiuvin ahi.  
\p “Jingleh che kitnun Keiman amaho khu nangho khutna ka pehdoh ding ahitai,” tin Pakaijin aseijin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Hijeh chun Israel te Gibeah kimvel jouse ah chun chaang apang tauvin ahi.  
\v 30 Amaho chu anithum channin akondoh kit un, chule masanga apansatna mun uvah chun apansa kit un ahi.  
\v 31 Benjamin mite chu amaho kisatpi dinga ahung kondoh phat un akhopi uva kon chun atoldoh tauvin ahi. Hiti chun amasa ana bolna bang-bangu chun Israel te chu tollhang leh lamlen chungah, khat chu Bethel lang jotna khat chu Gibeah langa akinungle nau munnah mi somthum athat tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Hichun Benjamin sepai ho chun, “Eihon amasa a bang-bang chun ijoukit tauve” tin asam’un ahi. Ahinla Israel te chu jam ding chuleh Benjamin mite chun ahindel diu, chujongleh hitia chu akhopi uva konna potdoh sahna ding thilgon anagon masat u ahi.  
\v 33 Israel te sepai abulpi ho chun Baal-tamar ahunglhun phat un galsatna dingin panmun ahin latoh tauvin ahi. Langkhat ah Israel te Gibeah lhumlam'a ana kisel ho chu galsat din akiselna uva kon'in ahung chomdoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 34 Israel sepai lah a galsatna thempen ho chu mi sangsom Gibeah khopi nokhum dingin asollut tauvin ahi. Gal kisat chu akhoh lheh jengin Benjamin ten amanthahna diu ahilam akihet pouvin ahi.  
\v 35 Hiti chun Pakaijin Israel mite chu Benjamin mite chungah gal ajosah in hiche nikho chun Israel ten Benjamin sepai te chemjam'a galsatje them cheh 25,100 athatnun ahi.  
\v 36 Hichun Benjamin ten gal alel diu chu akimuchet tauvin ahi.  
\p Israel te chun Gibeah nokhum dinga changpanga akoihou chu akisonpi jeh un Benjamin sepai hoa kon chun anung chonun ahi.  
\v 37 Hijou chun ana changpang ho jouse chu muntin'a kon'in ahung potdoh un khopi sunga um jouse chu athat tauvin ahi.  
\v 38 Ama hon ana kihoutoh masat nau dungjuijin khopi sunga chun meikong khu lentah agah kondoh sah tauvin ahi.  
\v 39 Israel ten hiche meikhu chu amu phat un, amaho ahung kileheijun Benjamin sepai te anokhum tauvin ahi.  
\p Hiche achun Benjamin gal-hang hon Israel te somthum athat’un ahileh “Eihon ina kisatto nau masa tobanga chu tua jong ijokit u ahitai” tin kholhang asam tauvin ahi.  
\v 40 Ahinlah Benjamin sepai ho chu akinung hei uva avet uva ahileh khopi sung muntinna konna meikhu kitungdoh jeng chu amu uvin ahi.  
\v 41 Israel mite chu akinung heijun akisatpi tauvin ahi. Hiche phat chun Benjamin mite chun amanthahna diu chu ahunglhunga ahitai ti ahedoh tauvin ahileh atija lheh tauve.  
\v 42 Hijeh chun akinung heijun Israel mitea kon chun ajam’un gammang lah adel tauvin ahi. Ahinla ajamdoh jou pouvin ahi, chuleh akhopi vella konna hungdoh ho jong chu aban thagam tauvin ahi.  
\v 43 Israel miten Benjamin mite chu aum kimvel’un, chuleh adellun Gibeah solanga aphapa uvin ahi.  
\v 44 Hiche ni chun Benjamin mite lah a gal-hatpen ho 18,000 athat tauvin ahi.  
\v 45 Ahoidoh ho chu gammang le Rimmon songpi bel dingin ajam tauvin ahi, ahinla Israel ten amaho lah a 5,000 chu lampiah athatpa tauvin ahi. Ama hon adelpeh kit nalaijun Gidom kom'ah 2,000 anathat kit nalaijun ahi.   
\p
\v 46 Hiche nikho chun Benjamin phungmi chemjam mangcha a galsat hat cheh 25,000 athiuvin,  
\v 47 Amoh cheng mi 600 chu Rimmon songpi langah ajamlut un hichea chun lha li sungin achengun ahi.  
\v 48 Chuleh Israel te chu ahung kile uvin khopiho sunga cheng jouse ahin bantha uvin, mipi ahin gancha ahin amu amangu chu abantha soh jengun ahi. Ama hon ahunglut lutnau khopi jouse jong chu ahin ban hallhah jengun ahi.   
\c 21  
\s1 Israel ten Benjamin Phung Mite Jiding Aholpeh U  
\p
\v 1 Israel ten Mizpah a kihahselna khat aneiyun, “Eihon Benjamin phung mite pasal ho hi ichanu teu ipehlou diu ahi” atiuve.  
\v 2 Chuin Israel mipite chu Bethel’ah acheuvin Pakai angah nilhah geijin lungna tah leh lainatah in akapmun ahi.  
\v 3 Amaho apeng jah jengun, “O Pakai, Israel Pathen, Israel sunga i-atileh hitobanga hi lhunga hitam? Tun kaphung lah uva khat hi Israel a kon'in amangthah tai!” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Ajing jingkah matah in mipi ten maicham khat asem’un pumgo thilto leh chamna thilto abol’un ahi.  
\v 5 Hijou chun ama hon aseijun, “Eihon Pakai angsunga Mizpah munna ikikhop uva chu Israel phunglah a koipen ahung panglou um am?” atiuvin ahi. Hiche pet a chu ama hon kihahselna gimnei tah ananei uva koi hileh ahung panglou chu thadoh jeng ding ahi ana tiu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Israel ten asopiu Benjamin dingin lunghemna aneiyun hitin aseijun ahi, “Tunin Israel phunglah a khat hi amahthah tai.  
\v 7 Eihon athimoh mi themkhat dinga hi aji diu iti ingaito peh diu hitam? Eihon la amaho kichenpi dinga ichanu teu ipeh louhel diu ahi, tia kitepna ineiyu ahitan,” akitito tauve.   
\p
\v 8 Ama hon aseijun “Pakai anga Mizpah mun a ikikhop pet uva chu Israel phung holah a konna koipen ham ahung pang louva chu?” atiuve. Hiti chun ama hon Jabesh-gilead a kon'in koimacha ahungpang poi ti amudoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 9 Ajeh chu ama hon mipi ho chu asimtoh uleh Jabesh-gilead mi khatcha ana pang pon ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hijeh chun mipi chun ama hon gal-hat cheh 12,000 alhengdoh un Jabesh-gilead mite chu numei chapangho geiya gathat dingin asol’un ahi.  
\v 11 Ama hon aseijun, “Hitia hi nabol diu ahi, pasal ho jouse leh nungah pasal toh lumkhomsa jouse jong nahin suhmang sohkei diu ahi,” atiuve.  
\v 12 Ama hon Jabesh-gilead a chengho lah a chun pasal toh lumkhom khaloulai cheh nungah theng 400 ahin mu uvin amaho chu Canaan gam Shiloh mun’ah ahin puilut un ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Israel khoppi pumpi chun Rimmon songpia kisel Benjamin mite athimoh ho kom'a chun chamna thulhut ding mi asol’un ahi.  
\v 14 Hiti chun Benjamin miho chu a inmun a ahung kileuvin chuleh Jabesh-gilead a kihinghoi numei 400 ho chu amaho jidingin apeuvin ahi. Ahinla numei ho chu amaho abonchauvin achangsoh jou pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Mipi ho chu Benjamin dingin ana lunghem lheh jengun ahi, ajeh chu Pakaijin Benjamin chu Israel phung lah a akeh lhah ahitan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun khoppi lamkai ho chun, “Benjamin phunga numeiho lah athigam tan, tua amoh chengho jiding chu iti iholdoh diu hitam?” atiuve.  
\v 17 “Israel phungkhat chu moh manthah thei louding ahi. Benjamin phung chu ahung kidodoh theina ding lampi iholdoh diu angaije” atiuve.  
\v 18 Ahinlah eihon amaho jidinga achanu pipen pen chu Pathen sapset chan dinga kihahselna gimnei tah inabol’u ahijeh a chu amaho dinga ichanu teu ipethei pouvin ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 19 Hiche jou chun ama hon kumseh a Shiloh munna Pakaiya dinga kut kibolji chu ahin geldoh un ahi. Hiche Shiloh hi Lebonah lhanglam, Bethel sahlam Bethel’a konna Shechem’a lamlen solama um ahi.  
\v 20 Ama hon numei changlou lai Benjamin mite chu aseipeh un, “Cheuvin lang lengpi leiya khun gakisellun lang,  
\v 21 Shiloh nungah ho khu laam dinga ahung potdoh tengu leh lengpi leiya kon'in hung lhaidoh unlang mikhatnin khat cheh gakimat uvin lang Benjamin gam na inlang uvah kipuilut unlang kichenpi uvin,” ati tauve.  
\v 22 Apateu ahilouleh asopi teuvin keiho kom'a ahung uva kiphinna ahung nei uva ahileh keihon amaho jah a, ‘lunghang hih un, amaho khu khoto jouvin, na chanu teu chu phalpeh jengun, keihon Jabesh-gilead ka suhmang uchun aji diu kamujou peh tapouve, chuleh nangho na nopna tah uva na chanu teu napeh u ahilou jeh in nakitep nau chu na sukeh deh pouve tiuving ting anajol lungdam nauvinge,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 23 Hiti chun Benjamin mite chun aseipeh bangun ana bol tauvin, nungah ho chu alampet uchun mikhat in khat cheh akimat un aji dingin akilhoh doh tauvin ahi. Ama hon agam langa akileuvin akhopiu akisemphat un chennan anei tauve.   
\p
\v 24 Hiche jou chun Israel mipite jong akipatdoh un ama insung leh aphung dungjuijin ama-ama in cheh a akile tauve.   
\p
\v 25 Hichelai khanga chun Israel ten leng ana nei pouvin, mipi ho chun ama mitvet a dih asah dungjui cheh in ana chon’un ahi. \x + \xo 21:25 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 17:6\x*   